<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Kami Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga unogile vija vuwandikigwe na Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mata</para>
  <para style="mt2">USENGA UNOGILE VIJA VUWANDIKIGWE NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="imt">MBULI ZA ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga Unogile vija viyandikigwe na Matayo ni umwe mwa vitabu vine vili mdi Lagano da Sambi vija vifambula ugima wa Yesu Kilisito. Chila chimwe chokemigwa, “Injili,” manake, “Usenga unogile.” Vitabu vandikigwa na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana, haja viyadanganike Yesu. Weli na ilimu hawamanyile talehe ilihi hasa usenga unogile wa Matayo wandikigwa, mbali yodahika kua yandikigwa mmilao 60 haja viyavumbuke Kilisito. Ivija, hanhu hawandikile usenga uno hahamanyika bule, mbali wanhu wengi wagesa wandikila muisi ya Palesitina na ivija muikae ya Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yandike chitabu chino Matayo, yakalile mgoga kodi kabula ya Yesu hamkemile kua mwaluko wake. Matayo ivija kakala komanyika kwa zina da Lawi. Matayo imwe mwa waja Watumigwa kumi na waidi na kawandikila wasomaji wa kiyahudi. Gano gaoneka kweli gaja gandikigwe mmayandiko sitini na Lagano da Mwaka. Matayo kalonda kulonga kua Yesu iyo ija Masia, Mlohozi yasaguligwe na Mulungu, kakala kalagusiligwa mbuli zake. Matayo ivija kandika mbuli nyingi za ufaume wa Mulungu. Wayahudi wagesa Masia kokwiza kua mfaume wa ulongozi wa isi. Matayo kaitiganya ng'hani kuwalongelela mbuli iyo kwa kuhinduka gaja gawatogole kwa muhe wa ufaume wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga unogile vija viwandikigwe na Matayo ni chitabu chinogile chifaya kusonga Lagano da Sambi kwavija mbuli nyingi za kusondelela mbuli nyingi zilawa mdi Lagano da Mwaka. Zolumba ma Lagano maidi. Weli na ilimu ivija wotonga kua Matayo kakoleleza wandikaji wa viitabu va Musa,” ni vitabu vitano vilongole va Lagano da Mwaka.</para>
  <para style="iot">Geliumo</para>
  <para style="io1">Matayo kausonga Usenga Unogile kwa kulongelela mbuli za kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisito na kusonga sang'hano yake, muisula za 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io2">Amala Matayo kosimulila sang'hano za Yesu na mafundo gake mengi, muisula 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io3">Hachikomelezo mwasula za Matayo zolongelela mbuli ng'hulu ng'hani ya sang'hano ya Yesu yooneka muiifa na uzilibuko wa Yesu, muisula za 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Gano gago mazina ga lukolo lwa Yesu Kilisito, mwana wa Daudi, mwana wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibulahimu kamlela Isaka na Isaka kamlela Yakobo na Yakobo na ndugu zake, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda kamlela Pelesi na Zela, mamiyao kakala Tamali, Pelesi kamlela Hesiloni na Hesiloni kamlela Lamu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Lamu kamulela Aminadabu, Aminadabu kamlela Nashoni, Nashoni kamulela Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni kamlela Boazi, na mamiyake Boazi kakala Lahabu, Boazi kamlela Obedi, nayo mamiyake Obedi kakala Lutu, Obedi kamlela Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese kamlela Daudi ija yakalile mfaume. Daudi kamlela Solomoni, ija mamiyake kakala Betisheba yakalile mwehe wa Ulia. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni kamulela Lehoboamu, Lehoboamu kamulela Abiya na Abiya kamulela Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa kamulela Yehoshafati, Yehoshafati kamulela Yolamu, Yolamu kamulela Uzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia kamulela Yosamu, Yotamu kamulela Ahazi, Ahazi kamulela Hezekia, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekia kamulela Manase na Manase kamulela Amoni na Amoni kamulela Yosia, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia kamlela Yekonia na ndugu zake. Uo ukala msimo uja Wayahudi viwagaligwe mmahame uko Babuloni. <verse eid="MAT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Wayahudi viwagaligwe mmahame uko Babuloni, Yekonia kamlela Shealitieli, Shealitieli kamlela Zelubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelubabeli kamulela Abiudi na Abiudi kamulela Eliyakimu, Eliyakimu kamulela Azoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azoli kamulela Zadoki na Zadoki kamlela Akimu na Akimu kamulela Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi kamulela Eliazali na Eliazali kamulela Matani na Matani kamulela Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />nayo Yakobo kamulela Yusufu ija yakalile mulume wa Malia, mamiyake Yesu, yokemigwa Kilisito. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Ivo, hakala na vilelo kumi na vine kulawa Ibulahimu mpaka Daudi na vilelo kumi na vine kulawa Daudi mbaka msimo wa Wayahudi viwasoligwe kuvihame Babuloni, na vilelo kumi na vine kulawa msimo wa Wayahudi kugaligwa mmahame Babuloni mbaka Kilisto.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ivo kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisito kukala vino: Malia mami yake Yesu kakala kalaviligwa vilama na Yusufu, mbali wang'hali hawanafunga zengele Malia koneka kamha inda kwa udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Kwavija Yusufu, mulume yamlavile vilama Malia kakala munhu yotogoligwa, halondile kumgela chinyala Malia hazelu, kalonda kumleka kwa kinyele. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Viyakalile yang'hali yoitonga mbuli iyo mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamlawila mzi nzonzi, kamlongela, “Yusufu, mwana Daudi, sekeudumbe kumsola Malia yawe mwehe wako, manake inda yeli nayo ya udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Nayo koibasula mwana wa chilume na gweye komwing'ha zina da Yesu, manake iyo yonda kuwalohola wanhu wake kulawa mmalozo gao.” <verse eid="MAT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ivo, ganogose galawilila ili divikile dija Mndewa diyalongile kubitila mlagusi wa Mulungu kua, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Mvimanye mhambe kokwamha inda, kolela mwana wa chilume, nao womkema zina jake Emanueli,” manake, “Mulungu kahamwe na cheye.” <verse eid="MAT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Yusufu viyalamke kulawa mzinhongo katenda kama vialagizigwe na mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, kamsola Malia kuwa mwehe wake. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Mbali Yusufu hammanyile mwehe wake mbaka viyaibasule mwana wa chilume. Nayo Yusufu kamwing'ha zina, kamkema Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu weli na ilimu ya nhondo wavika kumlola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu viyavumbuke muikae ya Betelehemu uko Uyahudi, msimo Helode viyakalile mfaume. Bahaja tu viyavumbuke Yesu, wanhu weli na ilimu ya nhondo kulawa kuusimbukilo wa zua wavika Yelusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />wauza,“Amwee! Kakulihi imwana, yavumbuke mfaume wa Wayahudi? Kwavija chiiona nhondo yake viilawilile kulawa kuusimbukilo wa zua, nacheye chiza kumfugamila.” <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Mfaume Helode viyahulike gago, iyo na hamwe wose wokala Yelusalemu, wagwa fufunhende ng'hani. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Ivo, Helode kawakema hamwe na walava nhambiko wakulu wose na wafunda ndagizi za Musa, kawauza, “Kilisito kovumbuka kulihi?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Wao wamwidika, “Muikae ya Betelehemu, isi ya Yudea.” Ivo viyandike mlagusi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Ngweye, Betelehemu isi ya Yuda, gweye huli mdodo mbee muulongozi wa kae za Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Kwavija kumwako kolawa mlongozi yonda yawalongoze Waizilaeli.’”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Baho Helode kawakema hamgwazo wanhu weli na ilimu ya nhondo na kulonda kuvimanya vinogile kulawa kumwao msimo nhondo ija viiyoneke. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Amala kawalagiza waite Betelehemu kawalongela, “Gendeni mkazambwile goya mbuli za mwana iyo, muhavimanya ngalileni usenga ili na nie nidahe kuita kumfugamila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Viwamtegeleze mfaume, waja wanhu weli na ilimu ya nhondo wasegela. Kumbe ija nhondo iwaonile ubanzi wa usimbukilo wa zua iwalongolela iita ima hachanha ha hanhu haja hayali imwana.<verse eid="MAT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Viwaionile nhondo ija wadeng'helela ng'hani. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Ivo, wengila mng'anda, wamuona ija mwana na Malia mami yake, waja wanhu watumbala mavindi, wamfugamila. Amala wafungula mbahasha zao, wamwing'ha nhunza, ikala zahabu, ubani na mavua ga manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Mulungu kawalalika mzi nzozi seke wabwele kwa Helode,” wabwela mzikae zao kwa kubitila nzila imwenga.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu na Malia na imwana Yesu wokimbilila Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Viwasegele waja nyambenyambe, Mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamlawila Yusufu mzinzozi na kumlongela, “Lamuka! Msole mwana na mami yake, mkimbilile Misili, mkale uko mbaka honda niwalongele, manake Helode kolonda kumkoma mwana iyo.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Baho Yusufu kalamuka, kamsola mwana na mamiyake, wasegela chilo waita Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />wakala uko mbaka viyafile Helode. Mbuli ino ilawila kugangamiza kweli diyalongile Mndewa kubitila mlagusi wa Mulungu, viyalongile, “Nimkema mwanangu kulawa isi ya Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wadodo wokomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helode viyavimanye kua waja weli na ilimu ya nhondo wambanga, kagevuzika ng'hani. Kalagiza wana wose wa chilume muikae ya Betelehemu na isi zilibehi yake weli na ukulu wa milao midi kubwela hasi wakomigwe. Kasang'hana kuilinga na chipindi chija kulawa viyaimanyile mbuli iyo kwa waja wanhu weli na ilimu ya nhondo.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ivo igangamiza kweli gaja galongigwe na Yelemia mlagusi wa Mulungu,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Dizi dihulikika uko Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Ndilo na kulombokeza ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli kowalilila wanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Nahalondakubembelezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Kwavija wana wose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Wadanganika.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kulawa isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Mazua madodo vigabitile kulawa viyadanganike Helode, mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamlawila Yusufu mzinzozi kuja Misili <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />kamlongela, “Lamuka! Msole mwana na mamiyake, ubwele kaidi muiisi ya Waizilaeli, kwavija waja walondile kumkoma mwana iyo wamala kudanganika.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Baho, Yusufu kalamuka kamsola imwana na mamiyake, wabwela muiisi ya Waizilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Mbali Yusufu viyahulike kua Alikelao, mwanage Helode, kakala kahazi ufaume wa tati yake muuisi ya Yudea, kadumba kuita uko. Nayo kwavija kalalikigwa mzinzozi kaita ubanzi wa Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />kahamila muikae imwe yokemigwa Nazaleti. Ivo vigavikile gaja galongigwe kubitila walagusi wa Mulungu, galongile, “Kokemigwa Mnazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizi koligula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mazua gaja Yohana Mbatizi kalawila yoligula mchiwala cha Yudea kalonga, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Hindukeni na kuleka malozo genu,” kwavija ufaume wakuulanga wammabehi!” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ino Yohana iyo ija mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya yamlongile mbuli zake, viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Dizi ya munhu yokema kulawa kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mtandileni goya Mndewa nzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Mgoloseleni nzila yake.’”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohana kakala na valo disonigwe kwa lusinga lwa ngamia, na mkwiji wa msipi wa mbende mchigudi chake. Ndia yake ikala nzige na uki wa kumbago. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Baho, wanhu kulawa Yelusalemu na waja walawile Uyahudi yose na mzi isi zose zili mumgwazo wa lwanda lwa Yolodani wamuwinza Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Nao wahinduka na kuleka malozo gao, nayo Yohana kawabatiza mulwanda lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Mbali viyawaonile Mafalisayo wengi na Masadukayo womwizila ili yawabatize, kawauza, “Mweye ulelo wa nyoka, yelihi yamfundeni muikimbile nyinukila ya Mulungu iyo ikwiza? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Laguseni mzisang'hano zenu kua mhinduka na kuleka malozo genu. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Seke mtonge na kuilongela, ‘Tata yetu Ibulahamu!’ Nomulongeleni kweli, Mulungu kodaha kugatenda mabwe gano gawe ulelo wa Ibulahamu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Nashoka dikigwa mwaka mmizizi,” kila mbiki uja haulela manhunda wokanhigwa na kwasigwa mmoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Niye nombatizani na mazi ili kulagusa kua mgaleka malozo genu. Mbali iyo yokwiza badili yangu kana udaho mkulu kubita nie, nie sidaha hata kumpapila makwabazi gake. Iyo kombatizani kwa Muhe wa Mulungu na kwa moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Lungo lwa mmakono gake, nayo kofagila lubuga lwake lwa kubetela, na kukunzanya uhemba wake mdigulu, na makumvi yagasome na moto uja haufaga.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatizigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Chipindi icho Yesu kalawa Galilaya kavika lwanda lwa Yolodani, kamuwinza Yahana yadahe kubatizigwa nayo. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Mbali Yohana kageza kumgoma na kulonga, “Ivo, gweye koniwinza nie? Niye iyo nilondeke kubatizigwa nagweye.” <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Mbali Yesu kamwidika, “Leka ikale ivo kwa sambi, manake cholondeka chigatende gaja gose Mulungu gayalondile.” Baho Yohana katogola.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Bahaja Yesu viyamalile kubatizigwa, kalawa mmazi, baho ulanga ugubuka, kaoneka Muhe wa Mulungu viyahulumuka kama njiwa na kakala hachanha yake. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Bahaja dizi kulawa kuulanga dilonga, “Ino iyo Mwanangu nili na wende nayo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Kogezigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12-23">Maluko 1:12-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Amala Yesu kalongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu mbaka kuchiwala ili yagezigwe na Mwenembago. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Yesu kafunga kwa mazua alubaini hadile hebu kung'wa misi na chilo hachikomelezo kaona nzala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Baho Mgezaji keza kamulongela,“Uhawa gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu, galongele mabwe gano gageluke migate.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Baho Yesu kamwidika, “Yandikigwa, ‘Munhu hakala kwa migate iiyeka, mbali na kila usenga ulawa kwa Mulungu.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Labaho Mwenembago kamsola Yesu mbaka isi inang'hane ya Yelusalemu na kumwika kuchahna mwa Ng'anda ya Mulungu, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />na kamulongela, “Yahawa gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu, ibwanhe hasi, manake yandikigwa mmayandiko ga Mulungu, ‘Mulungu kokulagizila watumigwa wa kumwake, wokusola mmakono gao, seke uikwale mmabwe.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu kamwidika, “Mayandiko ivija galonga, ‘Seke umgeze Mndewa Mulungu wako.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Amala Mgezaji kamgala Yesu mbaka kulugongo lutali, kamulagusila ufaume wose wa isi na unovu wake, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Labaho kamulongela, “Nokwing'ha vino vose kama wahatumbala mavindi na kunifugamila.” <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Baho Yesu kamlongela, “Halawe hano Mwenembago gweye! Yandikigwa mmayandiko ga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:10">‘Komfugamila Mndewa Mulungu wako na kumsang'hanila iyo yaiyeka.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Baho, Mwenembago kamleka, na watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu weza, na kumsang'hanila.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kasonga sang'hano uko Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Maluko 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu viyahulike kua Yohana Mbatizi kafungigwa mdigeleza, yeye kaita Galilaya.<verse eid="MAT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Yesu hakalile Nazaleti, kasegela kaita Kapelinaumu, kae ili behi na lamba da Galilaya, muimhaka ya isi ya Zebuloni na isi ya Nafutali, kakala uko. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Gano galawilila kugangamiza ukweli kwa gaja gayalongile Mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya, viyalongile,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Isi ya zabuloni na isi ya Nafutali, kubitila kudilamba umwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, Galilaya isi ya wanhu haweli Wayahudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Wanhu wakalile muiisi ili na bung'hukila ng'hulu wadiona bung'hulo kulu. Nao wakalile muiisi ya ziza na bung'hukila ya ifa, bung'hulo diwa bung'hukila!”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kulawa chipindi icho, Yesu kasonga kuligula usenga wake yolonga, “Hindukeni na kuleka malozo genu manake ufaume wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wammabehi!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema wavula somba wanne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu viyakalile yogenda mugwazogwazo mwa lamba da Galilaya, kawaona wanhu waidi wa lukolo lumwe, Simoni yokemigwa Petulo na miage Andulea, wakala wovula somba na nyavu mdilamba. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Baho, Yesu kawalongela, “Niwinzeni, nie nomtendani muwagale wanhu kwa Mulungu badili ya somba.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Bahaja wazileka nyavu zao wamuwinza Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Viyagendile hamwande chidogo, kawaona wanhu wamwenga waidi wa lukolo lumwe, Yakobo na Yohana wana Zebedayo. Wano wakala mui ngalawa wosasala nyavu zao hamwe na tati yao Zebedayo. Baho Yesu kawakema, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />bahaja nao waleka nyavu zao na tati yao muingalawa, wamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofunda wanhu na kuhonya watamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Nayo Yesu kakala yogenda chila hanhu mui Galilaya, yofunda mzi ng'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na kuligula Usenga Unogile kwa mbuli ya ufaume wa Mulungu. Kahonya vitamu vao kwavija vivili na utamu wa chila munhu yeli nao. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Mbuli zake zenela chila hanhu muiisi ya Silia, watamu wose weli na vitamu vovose na waja wogazigwa na madununzo ga chila namna. Waja wambule chinyamkela, weli na utamu wa kugwa na waja waholole lukuli, wagaligwa kumwake, nayo kawahonya wose. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Mabumbila makulu ga wanhu kulawa isi ya Galilaya na Dekapoli na Yelusalemu na Yudea na umwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, wamuwinza.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koligula kulugongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu viyagaonile mabumbila ga wanhu, kakwela kulugongo, kakala hasi. Waluko wake wamwizila, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />nayo kasonga kuwafunda.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndeng'helelo ya kweli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />Wamweda waja wavimanyile kua womlonda Mulungu, manake ufaume wa kuulanga wao.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Wamweda weli na giogio, manake wao wokwiza kuhanigwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Wamweda weli na uhole manake wao wokwing'higwa isi iwe yao.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Wamweda waja wolonda ng'hani kusang'hana goyolonda Mulungu, manake Mulungu kowadahiza kusang'hana gago.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Wamweda waja wowaonela bazi wamwenga,manake Mulungu nayo kowaonela bazi.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Wamweda weli na muhe ubung'huke, kwavija wao womuona Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Wamweda waja wogala utindiwala, manake wokemigwa Wana Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Wamweda waja wodununzigwa kwa kusang'hana goyolonda Mulungu, manake ufaume wa kuulanga ni wao.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Mmweda mweye wanhu wahawaliga na wahawaonela na kuwavwizila ubananzi wa chila namna kwa mbuli yangu.<verse eid="MAT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Sekeni na kutenda galigali manake nhuzo yenu ng'hulu kuulanga. Saho ivo viwawaonele walagusi wa Mulungu wakalikabula yenu.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munyu na bung'hulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Mweye mwa munyu wa isi, mbali munyu uhazabuka wogeligwa choni ikolele? Haufaya chinhu bule, wokwasigwa na kukanyagigwa na wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Mweye mwa bung'hulo da isi! Kama kae izengigwe halugongo haifisika. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Na wanhu hawabwina muli na kugubika mdidebe, mbali wodika hachanha haichingolobweda ili diwabung'hulile wose weli mng'anda. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Ivija yolondeka bung'hulo jenu diwabung'hulile wanhu, ili wazione sang'hano zenu zinogile, wamtogole Tata yenu yeli kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofunda ndagizi za Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Seke mtonge kua niza kuilava ndagizi na mafundo ga walagusi wa Mulungu. Sizile kuilava mbali kuigangamiza kua kweli. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Nowalongela kweli, mbaka haja ulanga na isi vihabita, habule hata yandiko dodo hebu chihande chidodo cha ndagizi chonda chisegezigwe mbaka vose vonda venele. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ivo, munhu yoyose yoleka kutegeleza hata ndagizi imwe ndodo kubita zose, na kuwafunda wamwenga wasang'hane ivo, iyo kokua mdodo ng'hani muulongozi wa Mulungu. Mbali ija yonda yazigoge ndagizi na kuwafunda wamwenga iyo kokua mkulu muufaume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Leka ivo nowalongela, unovu wenu wa kumtogola Mulungu kama haubitile uja wa wafunda ndagizi na uja wa Mafalisayo, hamwingila mbee muufaume wa kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundo kwambuli ya ludoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mmala kuhulika wahenga walongeligwa kua, ‘Seke ukome! Yonda yakome kolamuligwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Mbali nie nowalongela, yoyose yonda yamgevuze miage kolondeka yalamuligwe. Na yonda yamzeleu miage na kumuona mbozi kogaligwa mchitala. Ivija yonda yamkeme miage ‘Mbozi’ kolondeka kwingila muumoto uja haufa. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Ivo, uhagala nhosa yako yakulukuzigwa mchilemela amala kuvimanya kua muihasanya na miago, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />ileke nhosa yako mchilemela labaho ubweleganye kwa miago mkailumbe amala ubwele ukalave nhosa yako. <verse eid="MAT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Ilumbe na muhasanyi wako hima kuno mng'hali mzila kuita mchitala. Hebu mhasanyi wako kokugala kwa mlamuzi, nayo mlamuzi kokugala kwa mmilizi, nagweye kogeligwa mdigeleza. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nokulongela kweli, hulawa umo mbaka ikulawe ija sente ya ngama yuudaigwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundo kwambuli ya ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Yesu kagendelela kulonga, ‘Muhulika wanhu walongeligwa kua seke utende, Ugoni!’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Mbali nie nowalongela yonda yamlole mwana chike kwa kummelela mate, tiyali katenda nayo ugoni mmoyo. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ivo, kama siso jako da kulume dihakuhonza kusang'hana ubananzi, ding'ole ujase kutali. Yofaya ng'hani kumwako kwagiza kilungo chimwe cha lukuli lwako kubita lukuli lwako lwose kwasigwasi muumoto uja haufa. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Yahawa mkono wako wa kulume wahakuhonza kusang'hana ubananzi, ukanhe ukawase kutali. Yofaya ng'hani kumwako kwagiza kilungo chimwe cha lukuli lwako, kubita lukuli lwako lwose uite muiisi ya wafile.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundo kwambuli ya nyasa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maluko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Imala kulongigwa ivija muindagizi ya Musa, ‘Yonda kumleka mwehe wake, kolondeka yamwing'he balua ya nyasa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Mbali nie nomlongeleni yomwing'ha mwehe wake nyasa kwa mbuli yoyose, mbali si kwa mbuli ya ugoni, komtendela mwehe wake ugoni, na mulume yahasola mwehe yeng'higwe nyasa si kwambuli ya ugoni, nayo kotenda ugoni.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundo kwambuli ya lahilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Kaidi muhulika wahenga walongeligwa kua, ‘Seke ubene lahilo jako, mbali kolondeka kugangamiza lahilo jako kwa Mndewa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Mbali nie nowalongeleni seke muilahile mbee mhailalika, hebu kwa ulanga manake icho chigoda cha ulongozi cha Mulungu, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />hebu kuilahila muiisi manake icho hanhu hakwika magulu gake, hebu sekemuilahile kwa Yelusalemu manake iyo kae ya Mfaume mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Ivija seke uilahile kwa ditwi jako manake hudaha kuitenda hata mvili imwe iwe nzelu hebu nhitu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ivo wahalonga, ‘Enaa,’ baho iwe ‘Enaa,’ na wahalonga, ‘Habule.’ Baho iwe ‘Habule.’ Chochose chonda chibite gago cholawa kwaija mbananzi.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundo kwambuli ya kulihiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Muhulika kua ilongigwa, ‘Siso kwa siso, zino kwa zino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Mbali nie nowalongeleni, seke umlihizile munhu yehile. Mbali munhu yahakutoa ng'hua kanza da kulume, muhindulile na da kaidi. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Na munhu yahakugala mchitala konda kukuboka shati jako, mleke yasole na koti ivija. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Munhu yahalonda kukuswangiza upape mbahasha yake kwa chilomita imwe, gweye upape chilomita mbili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Yonda yakupule, mwing'he, hebu sekeumuhindukile chisogo yokupula chinhu.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuweng'ha wende wahasanyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />Muhulika ilongigwa kua, ‘Mwing'he wende miago, na kumwihila mhasanyi wako.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Mbali nie nowalongeleni weng'heni wende wahasanyi wenu na kuwapulila waja womdununzani, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ili mdahe kua wana wa Tata yenu yeli kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Kwavija iyo kuwabung'hulila zua jake wanhu wehile na wanogile, na kuwatoela mvula wanhu wanogile na wabananzi. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ivo mopata choni mhaweng'ha wende waja woweng'ha wende mweye tu? Manake, hata wagoga kodi wosang'hana ivija. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ivija muhawalamsa walukolo lwenu waiyeka, ivo, msang'hana chinhu cha uzonza? Manake hata wamhazi nao wosang'hana ivo. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Baho muwe wa kutogoligwa kama Tata yenu viyali wa kutogoligwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Mafundo ga kuwataza wamwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Itiganyeni sekemsang'hane sang'hano zenu zinogile kwa wanhu ili mdahe kutogoligwa nao. Bila ivo, Tata yenu yeli kuulanga homwing'heni nhunza.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Ivo wahamtaza yelibule chinhu seke usimulile kwa wanhu. Seke utende kama vibilikizi viwasang'hana mzi ng'anda za kuiting'hanila wayahudi na mzila ili wanhu waweng'he nhogolwa. Nowalongela kweli wao wamala kubokela nhunza yao. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Mbali gweye uhamtaza chikumbi muyega, tenda ivo hata mbwigaako wahabehi seke yavimanye vuutenda. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Amala yokua mbuli yako ya chifiso. Na Tataako yoona chuutendile mchifiso, kokugweka.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundo kwambuli ya kupula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Mwahapula seke mtende kama viwatenda vibilikizi. Wao wolonda kwima na kupula mzi ng'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na mumgwazo mwa nzila ili wanhu wawatogole. Nowalongeleni kweli, wao wamala kwing'higwa gweko jao.<verse eid="MAT 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Mbali gweye wahapula, ingila mng'anda yako na hinda lwivi lwako, amala mpule Tata yako yeli mchifiso. Nayo tataako yokuona gautenda mchifiso, kokwing'ha ngweko. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Mwahapula, sekempule kama wamhazi viwapula, wao wotonga kua milungu yao yowategeleza kwavija viwapula kwa chipindi chitali. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Seke muilinge nao. Tata yenu tiyali kavimanya gomlonda kupula hata mng'hali hamnampula. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Vino, ivo vumlondeka kupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Tata yetu ulikuulanga kwa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Zina jako ditogoligwe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Ufaume wako uvike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Duulonda disang'hanike muiisi kama uko kuulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Uching'he lelo ndia yetu kama vuuching'haga. <verse eid="MAT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Ugele kumgongo ubananzi wetu uchitendile, kama vija na chele vichiwagelela kumgongo wachitendele gehile. <verse eid="MAT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Seke uchigele mmagezo, mbali uchilohole kulawa kwa ija mbananzi.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Kwavija mhagela kumgongo ubananzi wao uwawatendele, na Tata yenu yeli kuulanga kwa Mulungu kowalekesela namweye ubananzi wenu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Mbali kama hamgela kumgongo ubananzi wa wayenu, nayo Tata yenu hawalekeseleni namweye ubananzi wenu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofunda mbuli ya kufunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Mwahafunga sekemlaguse giogio mvihanga venu kama vibilikizi viwotenda. Wao wolagusa giogio mvihanga, wanhu wavimanye wafunga. Nokugangamizila kweli, wao wamala kulihigwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Mbali gweye wahafunga, sunha chihanga chako, na bakala mavuta mditwi, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />ili munhu yoyose seke yavimanye kua kofunga, mbali yavimanye Tataako tu ija haoneka. Na tataako ija yolola gautenda mchifiso, kokugweka.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuikila usigavu kuulanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Seke muikile usigavu muiisi hanhu mng'onyo nondo na ng'hutu hubananga, na wabavi hubena na kwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Muikile usigavu kuulanga hanhu ving'onyo nondo hebu ng'hutu hawadaha kubananga, hebu wabavi kubena na kwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kwavija hanhu hali na uzenzi wako, na moyo wako wabaho.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwa lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Meso ni kama lumuli lwa lukuli. Kama meso gako magima, lukuli lwako lose lokua mdi bung'hulo, <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />mbali kama meso gako gahabanangika, lukuli lwako lokua mdiziza. Ivo kama bung'hulo dilimgati yako ni ziza, ijo dokua ziza davilihi!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu na uzenzi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Habule munhu yodaha kuwasang'hanila wandewa waidi, kwiza komwihila imwe na komwing'ha wende imwenga, hebu koilumba na imwe na kumzeleu imwenga. Hamdaha kumsang'hanila Mulungu na uzenzi hamwe. <verse eid="MAT 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Iyo mana nowalongela seke mdumbe kwambuli ya ndia hebu nying'wa vimlonda ili muwe na ugima, hebu vivalo vimulonda kwa mbuli ya ng'huli zenu. Ivo, ugima ni ndia muhala hebu na vimwenga? Na lukuli vilihi haubita vivalo? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Waloleni ndege, wao hawahanda na kugobola hebu wabule gulu jojose. Hata ivo Tata yenu yeli kuulanga kwa Mulungu kowalisa. Ivo, mweye hamfaya ng'hani kwa Mulungu kubita wao? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Yelihi mmwenu kwa kuigaza kwake kodaha kuyongezela chimo chake cha ugima? <verse eid="MAT 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Habali mogaia vivalo? Loleni malua ga kudikonde vigakula goya, haga sang'hana sang'hano yoyose hebu hagailuka. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Mbali nowalongeleni, hata mfaume Selemani na uzenzi wake wose, havalile goya kubita lua dimwe mwa gago gali mdikonde. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ihawa Mulungu kodivaza yani dili mdikonde, dija lelo dabaha, na igolo donyala na dokwasigwa mmoto, ivo mweye hamtendeligwa ganogile kubita ijo yani mweye mli na nhogola ndodo! <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Ivo, sekemgae, ‘Choja choni na chong'wa choni hebu chovala choni!’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Kwavija gagaja gowagaiya wamhazi. Na Tata yenu yelikuulanga kovimanya kua molondeka kubokela gago gose. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ivo tanhu zambwileni ufaume wa Mulungu na gaja goyolonda, na gamwenga gose mokongezeligwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Ivo, sekemuigaiye igolo, kwavija igolo yoigaiya yenyego. Hailondeka kuhanganya madununzo ga chila zua.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Sekeuwalamule wamwenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luka 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Seke muwalamula wanhu wamwenga, ili na mweye Mulungu seke yawalamule na mweye. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Manake vija vimuwatendela wamwenga, ivija namweye Mulungu vonda yawatendele. Chipimo ichija chimupimila wamwenga icho chomupimiligwa namweye. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Habali gweye kochiona chibale chili mgati mwa siso da miago, mbali hudiona bale dili mdisiso jako?<verse eid="MAT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Hebu kodahaze kumulongela miago, ‘Leka nikulave chibale mdisiso jako, kuno gweye kuna bale mdisiso jako? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Kwa chibilikizi gweye! Tanhu lava bale dili mdisiso jako labaho kodaha kuchiona goya chibale chili mgati ya siso da miago na kuchilava. <verse eid="MAT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Seke muweng'he umbwa vinhu vinang'hane seke wawahindukile na kumulumeni, hebu seke muwapigisile nguluwe usalu wa bei ng'hulu seke waubojoge.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pula, zambwileni na toeni hodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Puleni na mweye mokwing'higwa, zambwileni namweye mopata, toeni hodi na mweye movuguliligwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Manake chila yopula kokwing'higwa, na yozambwila kokwiza kupata, na yotoa hodi kovuguliligwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />“Ivo yelihi mmwenu mwanage yahampula ndia komwing'ha dibwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Hebu, yahampula somba komwing'ha nyoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Mwahawa mweye mli wabananzi mvimanya kuweng'ha wanenu vinhu vinogile, nowalongela kweli Tata yenu yeli kuulanga kowasang'hanila ganogile ng'hani waja wompula.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Gose gamlonda wanhu wawasang'hanile, wasang'hanileni wao ivija. Vino ivo viilondeka muindangizi ya Musa na mahala ga walagusi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwivi mdodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Ingileni kwakubitila chiheleto, kwavija nzila ya kwingila muubananzi ya ugazi, na lwivi lwa kwingilila umo wa ugazi, wobitila nzila iyo wanhu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Mbali nzila ikulongoza muugima ni sisili, na lwivi lwa kwingilila umo nao mdodo. Wanhu wadodo tu wodaha kuimanya nzila iyo.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiki womanyika kwa manhunda gake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43">Luka 6:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Itiganyeni na walagusi wa uvwizi, wao wowezila kwakunze wooneka kama bung'hukilalo, mbali mgati yao kama mbwisi wakali.<verse eid="MAT 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Mowamanya kwa gaja gowasang'hana. Ivo, wanhu wokwaha zabibu mmibiki ya miwa, hebu manhunda ga msosowana mmisongoma? Habule! <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Ivo, mbiki unogile wolela manhunda ganogile, na ivija mbiki wihile wolela manhunda gehile. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Baho mbiki unogile haudaha kulela manhunda gehile, hebu mbiki wihile haudaha kulela manhunda ganogile. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Chila mbiki uja haulela manhunda ganogile wokanhigwa na kwasigwa mmoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Kwaivo mowamanya kwa sang'hano zao.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simmanyeni mweye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />Si chila munhu yong'hema Mndewa, Mndewa kokwingila muulfaume wa kuulanga, mbali ija yosang'hana goyolonda Tataangu yeli kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Mdizua ijo da ulamuzi dihavika, wanhu wonilongela, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa! Kwa zina jako chiligula usenga wako, ivija kwa zina jako chiwalava vinyamkela na kusang'hana mujiza. <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Baho nowalongela, ‘Siwamanyile mbee. Segeleni hamwangu, mwewe wabananzi!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazengaji waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Ivo chila munhu yohulika mbuli zangu na kuzisang'hana, iyo koilinga na munhu yeli na nzewele, yazengile ng'anda yake muulongo mdala ulina mabwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Mvula yahatowa, vizanda vihamema, beho kulu dihabuma na kuitoa ng'anda iyo. Baho ng'anda iyo haigwa kwavija izengigwa mmabwe.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Ila yoyose yohulika mbuli zangu na hazisang'hanile, iyo koilinga na munhu mbozi yazengile ng'anda yake mmisanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mvula yotoa, vizanda vomema, beho kulu dobuma na kuisung'ha ng'anda iyo, nayo yogwa, na kugwa kwake kukua kukulu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udaho wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu viyamalile kulonga gago, bumbila kulu da wanhu dikanganya gaja mafundo gake. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Hagawile kama wafundaji wao wa ndagizi za Musa, mbali kafunda kama munhu yeli na udaho.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya munhu yeli na dikulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu viyahulumuke kulawa kulugongo, bumbila kulu da wanhu dimuwinza. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Ivo, keza munhu imwe yeli na dikulu, kamfugamila Yesu na kalonga, “Mndewa, wahalonda, kodaha kunihonya. <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu kagolosa mkono wake, kamwamha na kulonga, “Nolonda! Uhone.” Bahaja munhu ija kahona utamu wake. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Amala Yesu kamlongela, “Tegeleza, sekeumulongele munhu yoyose, ila genda ukailaguse kwa mlava nhambiko, na kulava nhosa ija iyalagize Musa kuwagangamizila kua kuhona.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya mutumigwa wa mmilizi mkulu wa chi Loma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Zua dimwe Yesu viyakalile yokwingila muikae ya Kapelinaumu, mkulu imwe wa wamilizi kamuwinza na kumpula <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />kalonga, Mndewa, mtumigwa wangu kawasa ukae, mtamu wa kuholola na kolumwa ng'hani.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu kamulongela, “Nokwiza kumuhonya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Mbali iyo mwamilizi mkulu wa Loma kamulongela, “Mndewa, nie silondeka wingile muing'anda yangu. Mbali longa mbuli yoyose tu ya udaho na mtumigwa wangu kohona. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kwavija hata nie nili haulongozi mwa wakulu wangu, nanie nina wamilizi iniwalongoza. Nihamlongela imwe ‘Genda!’ Nayo koita, na nihamulongela imwenga ‘Izo!’ Nayo kokwiza, na kwamtumigwa wangu, ‘Tenda vino!’ Nayo kotenda.” <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu viyahulike mbuli hizo, kakanganyika kawalongela wanhu waja wakalile womwinza, “Nowalongela kweli, sinaona munhu yoyose muiisi ya Izilaeli yeli na nhogola kama ino. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Ivo, nowalongeleni kua wanhu wengi wokwiza kulawa kuusimbukilo wa zua na uswelo wa zua, nawo wokala muindia hamwe na Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo muufaume wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Mbali waja walondeke kua mu uo ufaume wa Mungu wokwasigwa kunze, mdiziza, uko wolila na kuluma meno.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Amala Yesu kamulongela iyo mkulu wa wamilizi wa chi Loma, “Genda ukae na viwe kumwako kama vuutogole.” Na saa iija mtumigwa wake kahona.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu viyavikile ukae yake Petulo, kamvika nkoi wa chike wa Petulo kawasa mdikomwa, kana homa ng'hali. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Baho Yesu kamwamha iyo mama mkono, na homa ikunguzuka, kema na kumhunganikila. <verse eid="MAT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Viivikile chigulogulo, wamgalila wanhu wakalile wambule vinyamkela, nayo, kwakuwakomhokela tu kawawinga vinyamkela wose. Ivija kawahonya wanhu wose wakalile watamu. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Kasang'hana ivo ili kugangamiza gaja gayalongile mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">“Iyo mwenyego kochisegezela uzidilwa wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">Kavisola vitamu vetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu viwalondeka kukala kama wajalusona wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu viyaonile bumbila da wanhu dimzunguluka, kawalagiza waluko wake waloke umwambu mwa lamba. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Mfundaji imwe wa ndagizi za Musa kamuwinza kamlongela, “Mfundaji, nie nokuwinza hohose hauita.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu kamwidika, “Mbwisi wana mhango, na ndege wana mvulu, mbali Mwana munhu kabule hanhu hakuhumulila.” <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Amala munhu imwenga mwa waja waluko wake kamlongela, “Mndewa, nileke tanhu niite nikamuwande tataangu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Mbali Yesu kamulongela, “Niwinze! Waleke wanhu wawile kama wafile wawawande wafile wayao.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogala utindiwala muing'humbi ya mazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Baho Yesu kakwela muingalawa hamwe na waluko wake. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Bahaja bung'hukila ng'hulu da mazi dilawila mdilamba, mbaka ng'humbi da mazi disonga kuigubika ngalawa, mbali Yesu kakala yawasile utulo. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Waluko wake wamuwinza wamlamusa wolonga, “Mndewa chihonye chofa!” <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye wanhu muli na nhogola ndodo, habali modumba?” Baho kenuka kadikomhokela beho na dija lamba, baho hakala hupii. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Waja wanhu wakanganyika, walonga, “Munhu ino wa vilihi! Mbaka beho na ng'humbi vomtegeleza!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu waidi wambule vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu kavika muiisi ya Wagadala, umwambu mwa lamba, na uko wanhu waidi wambule vinyamkela waiting'hanila nayo kulawila maloloni. Wanhu wao wakala wogela woga ng'hani, mbaka hakala habule munhu yagezile kubita nzila iyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Nawo wasonga kuguta nyangi, “Konda choni kumwetu gweye Mwana Mulungu? Ivo, kwiza kuchidununza na chipindi hachinavika?” <verse eid="MAT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Behi na hanhu haja hakala na nguluwe wengi wosusiligwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Baho waja vinyamkela wampula,“Uhachilava chileke chiwengile nguluwe waja.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu kawalongela,“Enaa, gendeni.” Baho bumbila jose da vinyamkela diwalawa wanhu waja na diwengila nguluwe. Bumbila jose da nguluwe dipolomokela mumtelemko mkulu dididimila mdilamba na nguluwe wose wafila mmazi. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Amala wasusilaji wa waja nguluwe wakimbila waita kuikae. Uko wazilonga mbuli zose na mbuli ziwapatile waja wanhu wakalile wambula vinyamkela. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Baho, wanhu wose muikae ija walawa wamuwinza Yesu na viwamonile wampula yasegele mui isi yao.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya mtamu yaholole lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu kengila muingalawa, kaloka lamba kavika ukae yake. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Baho wanhu wamgalila munhu imwe yaholole lukuli, katambalazigwa mchilago. Yesu viyaonile nhogolwa yao, kamlomgela munhu ija yaholole, “Mwanangu seke udumbe! Kulekeseligwa malozo gako.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Wafunda ndagizi za Musa wamwenga wasonga kutonga, “Munhu ino komliga Mulungu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu kavimanya viwatonga, kalonga, “Habali motonga gehile mmoyo?<verse eid="MAT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Dilihi dibuhile ng'hani, kulonga ‘Kulekeseligwa malozo gako,’ hebu kulonga ‘Ima ugende?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ivo, nonda mvimanye kua Mwana Munhu kanao udaho muiisi wa kuwalekesela wanhu malozo gao.” Labaho kamlongela munhu ija yaholole, “Ima, usole chilago chako uite ukae yako.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Munhu ija yakalile yakolole kenuka, kaita ukae yake. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Wanhu wose wamemile haja, viwaonile gago galawilile, wadumba, wamtogola Mulungu yaweng'ile wanhu udaho kama uo.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu kasegela baho, na viyakalile yoita kamuona munhu imwe yokemigwa Matayo, kakala hanhu hakwamhila kodi. Baho, Yesu kamlongela, “Niwinze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Nayo Matayo kenuka na kumuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu viyakalile ukae kukala kuja ndia, wagoga kodi wengi na wabananzi, weza na kuja na Yesu hamwe na waluko wake.<verse eid="MAT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mafalisayo viwaonile gago, wawauza waluko wake, “Habali mfundaji wenu koja na wagoga kodi na weli na malozo?” <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu kawahulika kawalongela, “Wanhu weli na ugima hawalonda mlaguzi, mbali watamu iyo wolonda mlaguzi. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Ivo, kaifunzeni kuumanya ulonzi uno, ‘Nolonda bazi mbali sio nhambiko.’ Sizile kuwakema wanhu wanovu, mbali weli na malozo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundo kwambuli ya kufunga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Amala waluko wa Yohana Mbatizi wamuwiza Yesu, wamuuza, “Cheye na Mafalisayo chofunga mala nyingi, habali waluko wako hawafunga?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu kawedika, “Ivo, wagonekigwe mdizengele wolondeka kukala na giogio na kufunga wahawa hamwe na Mwenye zengele? Habule! Mbali chipindi chovika haja Mwenye zengele yahasegezigwa hamwao, chipindi icho chonda wawe na giogio na kufunga.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Wanhu hawasonela chilaka cha chivalo cha sambi mchivalo cha umwaka. Manake chilaka icho chodideka valo ijo daumwaka, na haja hadegeke hokongezeka. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Na wanhu hawagela divai ya sambi mmifuko ya mbende ya bung'hukilalo yamwaka. Wahatenda ivo mifuko iyo yotulika na divai yokwitika, nayo mifuko iyo yobanangika. Mbali wanhu wogela divai ya sambi mmifuko ya mbende ya sambi, na vose vidi, mifuko ya mbende na divai vokala goya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biti afisa na mama imwe wohonyigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesu viyakalile yolonga gago, afisa imwe Myahudi kavika, kamtumbalila kalonga, “Biti yangu kadanganika sambi baha. Mbali nokupula chite ukamwikile mkono wako nayo kohona.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu, kasegela hamwe na waluko wake kamuwinza. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Mama imwe yakalile na utamu wa kufua damu kwa milao kumi na midi, kamuwinza Yesu hachisogo kamha mhindo da valo jake. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Katenda ivo kwa kutonga mmoyo, “Nihajamha tu valo jake nohona.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu kahinduka kamona, kamlongela, “Biti sekeudumbe! Nhogola yako ikuhonya,” Mama ija kahona saa iija. <verse eid="MAT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Amala Yesu kengila mng'anda mwa ija afisa. Na viyaonile watoa filimbi za giogio na waja wanhu wamemile wolombekeza, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />kalonga, “Segeleni hano, biti ino hadanganike ila kawasa tu.” Nawo wamseka.<verse eid="MAT 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Baho bumbila da wanhu wakalile haja vidisegezigwe, Yesu kengila mng'anda kamwamha mkono biti iyo, nayo kenuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Mbuli iyo yenela ng'hani muiisi ija yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya vipofu waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu kasegela baho, viyakalile yoita, vipofu waidi wamuwinza woguta nyangi wokema, “Mwana Daudi chionele bazi!” <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Nayo Yesu viyengile mng'anda, wanhu wao waidi wamuwinza, nayo kawauza, “Ivo, motogola kua nodaha kuwahonya?” Nawo wamwidika,“Enaa Mndewa.” <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Baho Yesu kagamha meso gao, kalonga, “Na viwe ivo kama vumtogole.”<verse eid="MAT 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Meso gao gaona, nayo Yesu kawalongela kwa kugangamiza na kulonga, “Seke mmulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ino.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Mbali wao wasegela, walongelela mbuli za Yesu muiisi ija yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya mwenye ludanha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Wanhu viwakalile wosegela, wamwenga wamgalila Yesu munhu imwe yakalile na ludanha kwavija kakala yambule chinyamkela. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Bahaja chinyamkela ija viyalavigwe, munhu iyo yakalile na ludanha kasonga kulonga, wanhu wakanganya walonga, “Mbuli kama ino hainalawila mui Izilaeli!” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Mbali Mafalisayo wakala wolonga, “Munhu ino kowawinga vinyamkela kwa udaho wa mkulu wa vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowaonela bazi wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu kaita mzikae zose na mvijiji na kufunda mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi kuno yoligula Usenga unogile wa ufaume wa Mulungu, na kuhonya vitamu vose na uzidilwa wachila namna. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ivo viyawaonile wanhu, mabumbila kwa mabumbila, kawaonela bazi, kwavija wakala wodumba na hahawile na wa kuwataza kama ng'ondolo walibule msusilaji. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Baho kawalongela waluko wake, “Ndia imema mmigunda, mbali wagobolaji wadodo. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Ivo, mpuleni Mndewa Mulungu mwene uo mgunda yagale wagobolaji wagobole ndia yake.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Watumigwa kumi na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu kawakema waluko wake kumi na waidi, kaweng'ha udaho wa kuwawinga vinyamkela na kuhonya vitamu na uzidilwa wose. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Gano gago mazina ga waja waluko kumi na waidi yawakemile watumigwa, wa mosi kakala Simon yakemigwe Petulo na Andulea ndugu yake Petulo, Yakobo mwana Zebedayo na Yohana ndugu yake, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo na Batolomayo, na Tomasi na Matayo yakalile mgoga kodi, na Yakobo mwana Alifayo na Tadayo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni Mkananayo na Yuda Isikaliote ija yamhinduke Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalagiza watumigwa kumi na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu kawalagiza wao kumi na waidi na kuweng'ha ndagizi zino, “Seke muite kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga, hebu sekemwingile mzikae za wasamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Mbali muite kwa wanhu wa Izilaeli wao kama ng'hondolo wagile. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Gendeni mkaligule vino, ‘Ufaume wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wa mmabehi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Honyeni watamu, zilibuleni wafile na wahonyeni weli na dikulu, walaveni vinyamkela. Mwing'higwa bule na laveni bule. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Sekemsole mzikadi zenu zahabu, hebu madini ga sente hebu madini ga shaba. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Seke msole kadi yakupulila nzila, hebu koti da kusaula hebu makwabazi hebu mkwaju. Manake msang'hanaji kolondeka yabokele chitumetume chake. <verse eid="MAT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Mhengila muikae yoyose hebu chijiji, zambwileni munhu yalonda kuwabokela, kaleni muing'anda yake mbaka mhasegela hanhu baho. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Muhengila mng'anda, muwalamuse wenekae wenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Kama wenekae iyo wombokelani baho utindiwala wenu wokua nao. Mbali kama hawawabokela, utindiwala wenu wowabwelela mweye. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Kama munhu yoyose yahalema kuwabokela hebu kuwategeleza ivo mhalawa muing'anda iyo hebu kae iyo, kung'huseni timbwisi dili mmagulu genu, kulagusa kua waulema usenga wao. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nowalongeleni kweli, mdizua da kulamula, wanhu wa kae iyo Mulungu kowalamula hakulu kubita iwapatile wanhu wa kae ya Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa ndununza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maluko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Tegelezeni, nowalagiza kama bung'hukilalo hagati ha mbwisi. Muwe wabala kama nyoka, na wahole kama hua.<verse eid="MAT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Itiganyeni wanhu womlemeni, manake wowogala mchitala na kuwalibula miboko mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Kwambuli yangu mogaligwa haulongozi wa wakulu na wafaume ili mdahe kunilongelela kumwao na kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ivo, mhagaligwa mchitala, sekemdumbe molonga choni, chipindi chahavika mokwing'higwa gakulonga. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Manake si mweye monda kulonga mbali Muhe wa Mulungu wa iyo Tata yenu yolonga mgati yenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Ndugu komhinduka miage ili yakomigwe, na tata komhinduka mwanage nao wana wowatoa tata na mami zao na kuwagalila ifa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Wanhu wose wowagevuzikila mweye kwa mbuli ya Zina jangu. Mbali yonda yafunye moyo mbaka kuuhelelo iyo yonda yaloholigwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Wanhu wahawaonela muikae imwe kimbililileni muikae imwenga. Nowalongela kweli hamkomeleza miyanza yenu mzikae zose za Izilaeli kabula Mwana Munhu hanavika. <verse eid="MAT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Mwaluko hambita mfundaji wake, hebu mtumwa hambita mndewa wake. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Yofaya mwaluko kua kama mfundaji wake, na mtumwa kua kama mndewa wake. Ihawa mkulu wa ng'anda wamkema Belizebuli, ivo, waja weli mng'anda yake howakemigwa mazina gehile ng'hani?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yolondeka kudumbigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Ivo,sekemuwadumbe wanhu wao. Wofisa mbuli ziwasang'hana mbali dovika zua ijo baho wanhu wovimanya viwafisile. Chila muhnhu koimanya mbulu zao. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Gaja niwalongeleni vichikalile chiiyeka walongeleni wanhu, na gaja ganiwalongeleni kwa kunyong'onya, mulongeleni chila munhu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Sekemuwadumbe wao wodaha kukoma lng'huli zenu, mbali hawadaha kukoma muhe wako. Yolondeka kuwadumba ija yodaha kukoma lukuli na yahamala kukoma kanao udaho wa kuwagela ng'huli na muhe wenu muumoto uja haufa. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Sholwewanda waidi hawaguligwa kwa senti imwe. Mbali Mulungu hamleka hata imwe yalagale bila mwenyego kulonda. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Mbali kumwenu mweye, hata mvili zili mmatwi getu zose zipetigwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ivo seke mdumbe mweye wanhu wakutogoligwa ng'hani kubita sholwewanda wengi.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtogola na kumbela Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8">Luka 12:8</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:9">9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Chila munhu yonitogola hazelu iyo wangu, nanie ivija nomtogola ha Tataangu yeli kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Mbali yoyose yonibela ha wanhu, nanie nombela ha Tataangu yeli kuulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigalile utindiwala mbali uhasanyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Sekemtonge kua niza kugala utindiwala muiisi. Mbali ngala bung'hukila. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kwavija niza kugala uhasanyi kati ya wabwanga na tataake, kati ya biti na mamiyake na kati ya mke mwana na nkoi wake. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Na wahasanyi wa wanhu ni waja wa mng'anda yake.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Yeli na wende na tati yake hebu mami yake kubita kuning'ha wende nie hanifaya. Na yomwing'ha wende mwanage hebu biti yake hafaya kuwa mwaluko wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Na munhu hatogole kudununzika kwa mbuli yangu na kuniwinza iyo hanifaya. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Munhu yoikimila mwenyego iyo koyagiza, na ija yokwagiza ugima wake kwambuli yangu iyo koloholigwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gweko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maluko 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Yonda yawabokele mweye muing'anda yake, konibokela nie, na yonibokela nie kombokela ija yanilagize. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Yombokela mlagusi wa mulungu, kwavija mlagusi wa Mulungu, kobokela gweko da mlagusi wa Mulungu. Yombokela munhu yatogoligwe kwavija katogoligwa, kobokela gweko da munhu yatogoligwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Nowalongela kweli, yoyose yomwing'ha chikombe cha mazi gauzizimi imwe mwa wano wadodo, kwavija mjalusona wangu, kweli hakosa kubokela gweko jake.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Watumigwa kulawa kwa Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu viyamalile kuwalagiza waluko wake kumi nawaidi, kalawa baho kaita kuwafunda na kuligula mzikae zili isi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Nayo Yohana Mbatizi yeli mdigeleza kahulika mbuli ziyasang'hana Yesu Kilisito. Ivo, Yohana kawalagiza waluko wake, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />wamuuza ivo, “Gweye iyo ija yokwiza hebu chimbete imwenga?” <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu kawedikila kalonga, “Gendeni mkamlongele Yohana gaja gamuhulika na kugaona, <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />vipofu woona, mbete wogenda, weli na dikulu wonang'hanigwa, mswamagutwi wohulika, wafile wozilibuligwa na vikumbi muyega woliguliligwa Usenga unogile. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Wamweda wanhu waja wonhogola nie.” <verse eid="MAT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Baho, waja watumigwa wa Yohana viwakalile woita, Yesu kasonga kugalongela mabumbila ga wanhu mbuli za Yohana, “Muita kulola choni kuchiwala! Ivo mulonda kulola mbaya itigisigwa na mbeho? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Ivo, muita kulola choni? Muita kumlola munhu yavaile vivalo vinang'hane? Wanhu wovala vivalo vinang'hane wokala mzing'anda za wafaume. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Nongeleni, muita kulola choni? Ivo, muita kumlola mlagusi? Enaa, chimuonile chibita mlagusi. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Yohana Mbatizi iyo mbuli zake zandikigwa mmayandiko ga Mulungu, Mulungu kalonga, ‘Nomlagiza mtumigwa wangu yakulongolele yakutandile nzila.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Nowagangamizila, Yohana Mbatizi nimkulu kubita wanhu wose wakalile muiisi ino. Mbali yeli mdodo ng'hani muufaume wa kuulanga nimkulu kubita Yohana Mbatizi. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kulawa chipindi cha Yohana Mbatizi mbaka sambi, ufaume wa kuulanga wolemigwa kwa ludabwa, nawo weli na ludabwa wousola.<verse eid="MAT 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Manake mafundo gose ga walagusi wa Mulungu na ndagizi za Musa galagusa mbuli za ufaume wa Mulungu mbaka chipindi cha Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Kama mwahatogola ivo, Yohana iyo ija Eliya ija walagusi wa Mulungu walongile yalondeke kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Yeli na magutwi gakuhulika na yahulike! <verse eid="MAT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Mbali ulelo uno noulinga na choni? Wailinga na wana wakalile halubuga, kuno wowakema wayao na kuwalongela, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Chiwatowela chilongelonge, mbali hamvinile! Chiwembila nyila za ndilo mbali hamlombokeze!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Yohana viyezile kafunga kuja ndia na kung'wa divai, wao walonga kambula chinyamkela.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Viyezile Mwana wa Munhu, koja na kung'wa, wao walonga, ‘Mloleni ino, mmelo na mng'waji, mbwiga wa wagoga kodi na weli na malozo!’ Hata ivo nzewele ya Mulungu yooneka kua inoga kuilinga na sang'hano yake.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa kae hawamtogole Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Amala wanhu wa kae zija Yesu ziyasang'hane mizonza mingi, walema kutogola na kugaleka malozo gao, ivo Yesu kawakomhokela vihile wanhu wa kae izo. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Moluona Kolazini! Moluona Betisaida! Manake kama mizonza itendeke kumwenu ihatendeke kuja mzikae za Tilo na Sidoni, wanhu wake wahavalile vivalo va gunia umwaka na kuibaka maivu kulagusa kuwa waleka malozo gao. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Mbali nowalongeni, mdizua ijo da kalamula, mweye molamuligwa hakulu kubita wanhu wa kae ya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Nagweye Kapelinaumu koinula mbaka kuulanga? Habule kohulumusigwa mbaka isi ya wanhu wafile! Manake mizonza isang'hanigwe kumwako, yahasang'hanigwe uko Sodoma, kae iyo ihasigale mbaka sambi. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Mbali nowalongeleni, mdizua da kulamula mweye molamuligwa hakulu kubita Sodoma.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izoni hamwangu muhumule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21">Luka 10:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:22">22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Msimu uo Yesu kalonga, “Nokwing'ha hewela goo Tata, Mndewa wa kuulanga naisi, kwavija kuwafisa weli nzewele na weli na ilimu mbuli zino, na kuwagubulila wana wadodo. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Enaa, Tata ivo vuunogeligwe. <verse eid="MAT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Tata yangu kaning'ha vinhu vose. Habule yammanyile Mwana ila Tata, hebu yammanyile Tata ila Mwana, na yoyose ija Mwana yolonda kumgubulila, <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Izoni hamwangu mweye mose mdununzigwa na kuzamilwa na mbahasha za malozo, nanie nowatenda muhumule. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Ilumbeni na nie na kunisang'hanila, muifunze hamwangu manake nie na muhole na nabule magoda, namweye mohumula. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kwavija mafundo ganiweng'ha sio madala na mbahasha yangu mbewe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zua da kuhumula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Chipindi icho Yesu kakala yobita mmigunda ya uhemba Mdizua da kuhumula. Baho, waluko wake wakala na nzala, wasonga kukwanyula makwamvi ga uhemba na kuja lukuso. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Mafalisayo viwaonile gago wamlongela Yesu, “Lola! Waluko wako wosang'hana mbuli igomigwe kusang'hanigwa Mdizua da Kuhumula!” <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Kawedika kawalongela, “Ivo, hamsomile viyatendile Daudi na wayage viwakalilile na nzala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Baho kengila Muing'anda ya Mulungu, kaja ija migate ija ya laguso ija igomigwe kujigwa na wamwenga, mbali walava nhambiko waiyeka. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Hebu hamsomile mchitabu cha ndagizi za Musa kua walava nhambiko mdizua da kuhumula wobena ndagizi mui ng'anda ya Mulungu kwakusang'hana sang'hano, mbali hawapetigwa kua wabananzi?<verse eid="MAT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Ivo, nowalongeleni kua hana chinhu hano chikulu kubita ng'anda ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Maza mvimanyile mayandiko golonga, ‘Nolonda bazi mbali sio nhambiko ya kulunguza,’ mhalekile kuwalonga vihile wanhu walibule gehile, <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />kwavija Mwana wa Munhu kana udaho kwambuli ya Zua da kuhumula.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya munhu yeli na mkono uholole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu kalawa baho, kaita kui ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />umo kukala na munhu yaholole mkono. Mafalisayo wamwenga wakala baho ili kumgeza Yesu ili yapate mbuli, ivo wamuuza Yesu, “Ivo, yofaya kumhonya munhu mdizua da Kuhumula?” <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Yokuwaze mmwenu munhu imwe yeli na bung'hukilalo wake kengila mdikombo tali mdizua da kuhumula? Ivo hadaha kumwamha na kumlava mdikombo ijo? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Mbali munhu kofaya ng'hani kubita bung'hukilalo! Ivo, yofaya kutenda ganogile mdizua da Kuhumula.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Amala Yesu kamlongela munhu ija yaholole mkono, “Golosa mkono wako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Kaugolosa mkono wake nawo uhona ukala kama uja umwenga. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Ivo, Mafalisayo walawa wamwikila chigwena chakumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumigwa yasaguligwe na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Mbali Yesu viyahulike mbuli iyo kahalawa hanhu haja, wanhu wengi wamuwinza. Kawahonya watamu wote <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />na kawagoma sekewawalongele wanhu mbuli zake. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Kagasang'hana ivo ili gaja gayalongile Mulungu kubitila Mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya gawe kweli.<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />Ino iyo mtumigwa wangu inimsagule, ija nili na wende nayo, yoning'ha wende mmoyo. Muhe wangu nowika kumwake, nayo kowalongela ulamuzi wangu mziisi zose.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Iyo holema hebu hoguta nyangi, hebu dizi jake hadihulikika muinzila.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Hadibena dete dihondeke, hebu utambi ulawa yosi hauzima. Mbaka chila munhu honda yalamuligwa vijaviilondeka,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Na kumwake wanhu wose womtumainila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maluko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Amala wamgalila munhu imwe chipofu na yambule chinyamkela yamtendile kua na ludanha. Yesu kamuhonya na baho kadaha kulonga na kuona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Bumbila jose da wanhu dizaganyigwa kwa gaja Yesu gayatendile. Waiuza, “Ino sio mwana wa Daudi yalalikigwe na Mulungu? <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Mafalisayo viwahulike gago walonga, “Munhu ino kowalava vinyamkela kwakulongozigwa na Belizebuli, mkulu wa vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu kuno yovimanya viwotonga, kawalongela,“Ufaume wowose wahaihasanya na kuigola wenyego wobanangika, na wanhu wa ng'anda imwe wahaiasanya na kuigola wenyego kwa wenyego wobanangika. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Na ihawa Mwenembago komuwinga Mwenembago miage iyo koigola mwenyego mmabumbila, na hadaha kukala ng'hani kogwa! <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Mweye molonga nowawinga vinyamkela kwa udahi wa Belizebuli, ivo, wajalusona wenu wowalava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa yelihi? Kwavija wao wao wonda wawalamule mweye. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Mbali ihawa nie nowalava vinyamkela kwa udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu, ivo mvimanye kua ufaume wa Mulungu uwavikila. <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Habule munhu yodaha kubena ng'anda ya munhu yeli na ludabwa na kumboka vinhu vake, tanhu kolondeka yasonge kumfunga munhu ijo yeli na ludabwa, labaho komboka vinhu vake. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Munhu yoyose hailumbile nanie konilema, na yoyose hakunzanya nanie iyo kopwililisa. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Kwa ivo nowalongela, wanhu wolekeseligwa malozo gao na maligo gao gose, mbali hawalekeseligwa malozo ga kumliga Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Kaidi yolonga mbuli ya kumbela Mwana Munhu, kolekeseligwa malozo gake, mbali yolonga mbuli ya kumbela Muhe wa Mulungu halekeseligwa malozo gake, hebu muiisi ino hebu muiisi ikwiza.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiki na manhunda gake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Mbiki unogile wolela manhunda ganogile, na mbiki wihile wolela manhunda gehile. Mbiki womanyika kwa manhunda goyolela. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Mweye mwihihe kama nyoka weli na sumu! Modahaze kuilongela ganogile kuno mweye mwiha? Kwa mulomo munhu hulonga gomemeza mmoyo.<verse eid="MAT 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Munhu yanogile kolava mbuli zinogile mmoyo wake unogile, munhu yehile kolava vinhu vihile kulawa muumoyo wake wihile.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Ivo, nowalongeleni, mdizua da kulamula wanhu wolondeka kulava hesabu ya chila mbuli iyalongile ihile. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Manake kwa mbuli zako kotogoligwa kua kwabule dihile, na kwa mbuli zako kolamuligwa kua kwa mbananzi.<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulonda vilaguso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maluko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Amala wafunda ndagizi za Musa wamwenga na Mafalisayo wamuwinza Yesu wamlongela, “Mfundaji chonda kuona chilaguso kulawa kumwako.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu kawedika,“Ulelo wa mchipindi chino, waubananzi na ulibule nhogola! Molonda chilago? Hamwing'higwa chilaguso mbali chija cha Yona mlagusi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Vija Yona viyakalile mazua madatu mmunda mwa somba nyangumi misi na chilo, ivo Mwana wa Munhu vonda yakale mgati muulongo mazua madatu misi na chilo. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Wanhu wa Ninawi wolawila mchipindi cha ulamuzi, nawo wochilamula kua china ubananzi. Manake Waninawi wohinduka na kugaleka malozo gao kwambuli ya kuligula kwa Yona! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Malikia wa Sheba kokwima mchipindi cha ulelo uno vonda ulamuligwe, nayo kochilongeleza kua chibananga. Manake iyo kalawa kutali keza kutegeleza mbuli za nzewele za Mfaume Selemani, na nowagangamizila kua hano hana chikulu kubita Mfaume Selemani!<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />Chinyamkela yahalavigwa kwa munhu, huzunguluka zunguluka hanhu hanyalile kozambwila hanhu hakuhumula na kama hapatile, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />baho koilongela, ‘Nobwele ukae yangu kunilawile.’ Mbali yahabwela nakuivika ng'anda yabule chinhu, ifagiligwa na kuhambigwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Bahaja koita kuwasola vinyamkela wamwenga saba wehile kubita iyo, na wokwiza kukala umo. Na uzidilwa wake munhu iyo wokwiha ng'hani kubita viyakalile haumosi. Ivo vondaiwe kwa wanhu wano wabananzi.<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndugu na Mama wa kweli wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu viyakalile yogendelela kulonga na wanhu, mami yake ndugu zake wavika. Wema kunze walonda walonge nayo. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Ivo, munhu imwe kamlongela, “Lola mami yako na ndugu zako wahanze wolonda kulonga na gweye.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu kamuuza munhu iyo, “Mami yangu yelihi? Na ndugu zangu welihi?<verse eid="MAT 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Amala kagolosa mkono kwa waluko wake kalonga, “Wano wao mami yangu na ndugu zangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Manake yoyose yosang'hana goyolonda Tataangu yeli kuulanga, iyo iyo ndugu yangu na lumbu jangu na mami yangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Fundo da munhu yohanda mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Mdizua idija Yesu kalawa muing'anda ija, kaita kukala hamgwazo mwa lamba. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Mabumbila makulu ga wanhu gamzunguluka mbaka Yesu kakwela muingalawa na kakala. Baho wanhu wose wema hamgwazo mwa lamba. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Nayo Yesu kawalongela mbuli nyingi kwa kulinga mbuli. “Tegelezeni! Mlimi kaita kumiza mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Viyakalile yomiza mbeyu, zimwenga zilagalila mzila, ndege weza wazidonda. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Zimwenga zilagalila mmabwe hanhu hakalile na ulongo mdodo. Mbeyu zioneka zilopola kota mbali kwavija hakala na ulongo mdodo. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Na zua vidilawile mbeyu zotile zinyala kwavija mizizi yake haingile ng'hani, ivo mbeyu zotile zifa. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Zimwenga zilagalile mmiwa, miwa iyo ikula na kuzizonga. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Zimwenga zilagalila muulongo unogile, mmela wota, ukula na kulela, zimwenga mhule mia, zimwenga sitini na zimwenga salasini. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Yesu kakomeleza kwa kulonga, Yeli na maguti yahulike!<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maana ya kufunda kwa kulinga munhu yohanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luka 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Amala waluko wake wamuwinza wamuuza, habali kolonga na wanhu kwa kulinga mbuli?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mwing'higwa kuzimanya mbuli zija hazinagubuligwa muufaume wa Mulungu, mbali wamwenga haweng'higwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kwavija yeli na chinhu kokengezeligwa, mbali ija yelibule chinhu, hata chija chidodo yelinacho kobokigwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Lekaavo nolonga nao kwa kulinga mbuli, kwavija wolola mbali hawaona, wotegeleza mbali hawahulika hebu kuvimanya.<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Ivo mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya kawalongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Wanhu wano wotegeleza na kutegeleza mbali hawovimanya, wolola na kulola mbali hawaona.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Manake wanhu wano wadala kuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Na mmaguti gao hagadaha kuhulika goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Na meso gao galema kuona ukweli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Bila ivo wahaonile kwa meso gao, wahahulike kwa magutwi gao na wahamanyile kwa ubala wao, na kunihindukila, kolonga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Na nie nihawahonyile.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Mbali mweye mmweda! Kwavija meso genu goona na magutwi genu gohulika. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Nowalongela kweli walagusi wengi wa Mulungu na wanhu wengi wanovu wa Mulungu walonda kugaona gaja gamuona mbali hawadahile kugaona, na kugahulika gaja gamhulika, mbali hawadahile.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ufambulo wa kulinga munhu yohanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Baho mweye tegelezeni ufambulo wa kulinga munhu yohanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Yoyose yohulika usenga kwambuli ya ufaume wa Mulungu na havimanya, ni kama zija mbeyu zilagalile mzila. Ija mbananzi kokwiza na kusola kija kihandigwe mmoyo wake. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Zija mbeyu zilagalile mmabwe ni kulinga munhu yahulike usenga uo na bahaja kaubokela usenga kwa deng'o. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Mbali kwavija kabule mizizi mgati yake, usenga wokala chipindi chiguhi. Ivo magazo na madununzo gaheza kwa mbuli ya usenga uo, woleka kutogola. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Na mbeyu zilagalile mmibiki ya mmiwa zolinga na munhu yahulike usenga uo, mbali woga wa ugima uno na kulonda uzenzi wauzonga usenga uo, na haulela manhunda. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Na zija mbeyu zihandigwe muulongo unogile ni kama munhu ija yahulike usenga uo na kuumanya, nayo kosang'hana goyolonda Mulungu, na kokua kama munhu yahandile mbeyu, imwe mia, imwenga mbeyu sitini na imwenga mbeyu salasini.<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulinga mayani ga hembahemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu kawalinga wanhu mbuli imwenga,“Ufaume wa kuulanga uilinga na munhu yahandile mbeyu inogile mumgunda. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Chilo chimwe wanhu viwakalile wawasa, mbananzi keza kahanda mahembahemba muuhemba na kasegela. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Amala mbeyu vizotile na kukula na kulava mbelewela, na mahembahemba nago gasonga kufumula. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Watumigwa wa mwene mgunda wamuwinza wamlongela, ‘Mndewa gweye sikuhanda mbeyu zinogile muugunda wako, ivo mahembahemba gano galawa kulihi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Mwenemgunda kawedika, ‘Mhasanyi iyo yasang'hane ivo,’ baho watumigwa wake wamuuza. ‘Kolonda cheye chiite kugang'ola?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Nayo kawedika, ‘Habule,’ lekeni, ‘Kwavija mhang'ola mahembahemba moung'ola uhemba ivija. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Vilekeni vose vikule hamwe mbaka mumlao. Amala nowalongela wasengaji tanhu wakunzanye mahembahemba makinza makinza wagasome moto, labaho wasenge uhemba wawike mdigulu jangu.’”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuilinga mbuli ya mbeyu ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu kagendelela kuwalongela wanhu kuilinga mbuli imwenga,“Ufaume wa kuulanga uilinga na mbeyu ya haladali isoligwe na munhu imwe yaitile kuihanda mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Mbeyu iyo ni ndodo kubita mbeyu zose zili muiisi, mbali ihota na kukula yokua ng'hulu kubita mibiki yose ili mdikonde. Yokula na kua mbiki mkulu mbaka ndege wakuulanga wokwiza kuzenga mvulu mmakwamvi gake.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulinga mbuli ya amila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu kawalongela kulinga mbuli imwenga,“Ufaume wa kuulanga uilinga vino, mama imwe yaisolile amila na kuihanganya na usage wa ngano madebe maidi na nusu baho usage wose wolulumuka.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalonga kwa kulinga mbuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maluko 4:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu kafunda wanhu gano gose kwa kulinga mbuli, halongile jojose kwa wanhu bila kutumila kulinga mbuli. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Katenda vino kulagusa kweli gaja kalongigwe na mlagusi wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Notumila mifano nihalonga nao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Nowalongela gaja gafisigwe tangia kulumbigwa kwa isi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofambula kulinga mbuli za mahembahemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Amala Yesu kadilaga dija bumbila da wanhu na kengila mn'nga, waluko wake wamuwinza wamulongela, “Chilongele uja vija kulinga mbuli ya mahembahemba wogesa choni.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu kawalongela, “Munhu yohanda zija mbeyu zinogile ni Mwana wa Munhu, <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Mgunda uja iyo isi, zija mbeyu zinogile iyo wanhu waja ufaume wa Mulungu ni wao, mbali gaja mahembahemba iyo wanhu waja waija mbananzi, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />na mhasanyi yahandile mahembahemba gaja iyo Mwenembago. Mulao iyo uhelelo wa isi. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Kama vija mahembahemba vigakunzanyigwa na kusomigwa mmoto, ivo vondaiwe muuhelelo wa isi, <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana wa Munhu kowalagiza watumigwa wake wa kwa Mulungu, wawakunzanye kulawa muufaume wake waja wose wowahonza wanhu watende malozo, na waja wose watenda ubananzi, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />nakuwasa muumoto uja haufa, na uko wolila na kuluma meno. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Amala waja wanhu wa Mulungu wobung'huka kama zua muufaume wa Tataao. Kwaivo, yeli na magutwi na yahulike.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulinga mbuli ya usigavu ufisigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Ufaume wa kuulanga uilinga na chinhu cha bei ng'hulu chifisigwe mumgunda. Munhu imwe yachifisule kachifisa kaidi. Kadeng'helela ng'hani mbaka kaita kugula vose yeli navo, amala kabwela na kuugula mgunda uja.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulinga mbuli ya chinhu cha bei ng'hulu lulu chipatika muisomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Kaidi, ufaume wa kuulanga uilinga na munhu imwe yozambwila chinhu cha bei ng'hulu chipatika muisomba chikemigwa lulu, <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />na viyapatile iyo lulu imwe, kaita kugula vinhu vose yeli navyo, kabwela kuigula lulu ija.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulinga mbuli ya lwavu lwa somba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Ivija, ufaume wa kuulanga ulinga na lwavu utandigwe mdilamba na wokunzanya chila aina ya somba. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Lwavu vuumemile, wanhu waukwega mbaka mhwani, wakala hasi, wasagula somba wanogile waweka mmigelo yao, na waja wehile wawasa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Ivo vondaiwe muuhelelo mwa isi, Watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu wolawila, wowabagula wanhu wehile na wanhu watogoligwe <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />na wowasa wanhu wehile muumoto uja haufa, uko wolila na kuluma meno.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usigamavu wa sambi na waumwaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu kawauza kaidi mbuli zose ziyawafundile, “Mgamanya gano gose?” Wamwidika,“Enna.” <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Ivo Yesu kawalongela, “Kwaivo, chila mfundaji wa ndagizi za Musa yakalile mwaluko wa ufaume wa kuulanga koilinga na mwene ng'anda yolava muusigavu wake vinhu vaumwaka na va sambi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemigwa uko Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu viyakomeleze kulonga kulinga na mbuli iyo kalawa hanhu haja, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />na viyabwelile mchijiji chake. Uko kakala yofunda wanhu mui ng'anda yao yakuiting'hanila Wayahudi mbaka wakanganya. “Ino kapatahi nzewele na uzonza uno?” <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Ivo, ino sio ija Munhu yosongola vinhu va mibiki? Ivo, mami yake sio Malia, na ndugu zake sio kina Yakobo na Yusufu na Simoni na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Na lumbu zake sio wose chahamwe nao? Ivo kapatahi gano gose?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Baho wakala womlema. Yesu kawalongela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">“Mlagusi wa Mulungu kotogoligwa kila hanhu mbali sio muikae yake hebu muing'anda yake.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Na hasang'hane mizonza mingi haja kwavija hawamtogole.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Chipindi icho, mfaume Helode wa Galilaya kahulika nhogolwa za Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Ivo, kawalongela watumigwa wake, “Munhu ino iyo Yohana Mbatizi kazilibuka, iyo mana kana udaho wa kusang'hana mizonza. <verse eid="MAT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Helode iyo yamwamhile Yohana na kumgela muing'anda ya kufungila wanhu kwambuli ya Helodia, mwehe wa Filipo ndugu yake. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Chila mala Yohana kakala yamlongele Helode, “Havilondeka gweye kumsola mwehe iyo!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helode kalonda kumkoma Yohana, mbali kadumba wanhu kwavija wanhu wamtogola kua Yohana mlagusi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Mulusona wa mvumbuka ya Helode, biti Helodia kavina haulongozi ha waja wagonekigwe mulusona. Helode kanogeligwa <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />mbaka kamlalika biti iyo, “Noilahila kua nokwing'ha chochose chonda upule!” <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Nayo kuno koswangizigwa na mami yake, kampula, “Ning'he ditwi da Yohana Mbatizi bahano mdisinia!” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Nayo mfaume kagwa giogio, mbali kwavija viyailahile haulongozi ha waja wagonekigwe kalagiza yeng'higwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Baho Helode kalagiza mmilizi yaite muing'anda ya kufungila wanhu yakamkanhe ditwi Yohana Mbatizi. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Ditwi da Yohana digaligwa mditanda, keng'higwa ija biti nayo kasola kamgalila mami yake. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Waluko wa Yohana weza, wausola mtufi wake, wauwanda. Amala waita kumlongela Yesu mbuli iyo.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'ha ndia wanhu wobita elufu tano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu viyapatia mbuli iyo, kasegela hanhu haja kwa ngalawa, kaita hanhu halibule wahu ili yawe yaiyeka. Mbali wanhu viwapatile kuimanya mbuli iyo, wamuwinza kwa magulu kulawa mzikae. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Yesu viyatelemke kulawa muingalawa na kuona bumbila kulu da wanhu, moyo wake uwaonela bazi, na kawahonya watamu wao. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Viiviklie chigulogulo, waluko wake wamuwinza wamlongela, “Hanhu hano hamchiwala na zua diswa. Baho walage wanhu waite mvijiji waigulile ndia.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu kawalongela, “Sio mbaka waite, weng'heni mweye ndia.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Mbali waluko wake wamlongela, “China migate mitano tu na somba waidi.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ngalileni hano.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Kawalagiza wanhu wakale hasi mmayani. Amala Yesu kaisola ijaa migate mitano na waja somba waidi, kalola uchanha kuulanga, kavipulila ganogile ga Mulungu. Amala kamega ija migate, kaweng'ha waluko wake, nao waweng'ha wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Wanhu wose waja weguta. Amala waluko wakunzanya visigale na wamemenza vigelo kumi na vidi. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Waja wadile walume wovikila elufu tano bila kupeta wanachike na wana wadodo.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogenda uchanha ya mazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Bahaja, Yesu kawalagiza waluko wake wakwele muingalawa, wamlongole umwambu mwa lamba chipindi yeye kogalaga mabumbila ga wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Viyamalile kuwalaga wanhu, kakwela kulugongo yaiyeka kupula. Kakala uko yaiyeka yopula mbaka hadiswele zua. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Na chipindi icho ija ngalawa ivika mmabehi kuvika hagati ya lamba kulu, mbali itoigwa na nhumbi da mazi kwa vija beho dikala doisung'ha ngalawa. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ichilo habehi na kukunguzuka, Yesu kawawinza waluko wake kuno yogenda uchanha mmanzi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Waluko wake viwamonile yogenda uchanha mmazi wadumba ng'hani walonga,“Uno mzimu!” Waguta bung'hukila kwa kudumba. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Bahaja, Yesu kawalongela, “Nyamaleni, iyo niye. Sekemdumbe!” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petulo kamlongela, “Mndewa, iyawa iyo gweye kweli, nilongele nikuwinze uchanha mmazi.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu kalonga, “Haya, izo.” Baho, Petulo katelemka kulawa muingalawa, kagenda uchanha ya mazi, kamuwinza Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Mbali Petulo viyaonile dija beho, kadumba na kasonga kudidimila, kalila kwa dizi yokema, “Mndewa nilohole!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Baho, Yesu kagolosa mkono wake na kumwamha, kamlongela, “Gweye ulina nhogolwa ndodo! Habali kuona woga?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Amala wakwela muingalawa, na beho ditindiwala. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Wose wakalile mgati ya muingalawa watumbala mavindi na kumfugamila, walonga, “Gweye kweli Mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohonya watamu kuja isi ya Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maluko 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Waloka umwambu wa lamba, wavika isi ya Genezaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Wanhu wa uko Viwammanyile kua iyo Yesu, wapwililisa mbuli zake chila hanu. Baho, wamgalila Yesu watamu wose. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Wampula yawalekele wamwamhe tu mhindo ya valo jake. Nao wose wamwamhile wahona.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mahala kulawa kwa Wahenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maluko 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Amala Mafalisayo chidogo na Wafunda ndagizi za Musa wavika kulawa Yelusalemu, wamuwinza Yesu wamuuza, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Habali waluko wako hawagesa mahala gachibokele kulawa kwa Wahenga wetu? Hawasunha mikono yao mbaka muiching'o kama viilondeka kabula ya kuja!” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu kawedika, “Na mweye habali hamgesa ndagizi za Mulungu ila mogesa mafundo genu wenyego? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Mulungu kolonga,’Wategeleze tata na mami yako,’ na ‘Yomliga tata na mami yake kolondeka yakomigwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Mbali mweye mowafunda vino munhu yahawa na chinhu chija chofaya kumtaza tata yake hebu mami yake, mbali kolonga, ‘Chinhu chino nomlavila Mulungu,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />ivo, mweye mowafunda sekewawategeleze kaidi tata na mami yake! Ivo vumzeleu usenga wa Mulungu kwa kuwinza mafundo genu wenyego. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Mweye watenda giladi! Mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya kalagusa goya kwa mbuli yenu,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Mulungu kolonga, wanhu wano wonhogola kwa mulomo tu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">Mbali mmoyo mwao wakutali na niye.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kunifugamila kwao hakufaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">Manake mafundo goofunda ni ndagizi za wanhu tu!’”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zimtenda munhu sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maluko 7:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu kadikema dija bumbila da wanhu, kawalongela, “Tegelezeni, mvimanye! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Chinhu chimtenda munhu sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu sio chija chingila mmulomo, mbali chija chimlawa mmulomo, “Icho icho chimtenda munhu sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Amala waluko wamuwinza, wamlongela, “Ivo, kovimanya kua Mafalisayo wagevuzika viwahulike chuulongile?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Mbali nayo kawedika, “Chinhu chochose hachihandigwe na tata yangu yeli Kuulanga, chong'oligwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Walekeni wenyego! Wao vipofu, vilongozi wa vipofu, na chipofu yahamlongoza chipofu miyage, wose waidi wotumbukila mdikombo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petulo kalonga, “Chifambulile kulinga mbuli uko.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu kalonga, “Hata mweye hamvimanyile? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Ivo, hamvimanyile kua chila chingila mmulomo choita mmunda amala cholawa kunze chokwasigwa kuichoo? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Mbali mbuli zilawa mmulomo zolawa mmoyo, na gago gao gomtenda munhu sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kwa vija, muumoyo molawa nhonga ya kukoma na ugoni na luhadu na ubavi na kulonga uvwizi na kuliga. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Gago gago gomtenda munhu sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu. Mbali kuja ndia bila kusunha mkono mbaka kuiching'o kama viilondeka hakutenda munhu sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhogola ya Mama imwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maluko 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu viyasegele hanhu haja kaita kukala ubanzi wa Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Baho mami imwe yakalile yokala baho na hakalile muyahudi kamuwinza Yesu, kaguta dizi kalonga, “Mndewa mwana wa Daudi, nionele bazi! Biti yangu kambula chinyamkela na kodununzika ng'hani.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Mbali Yesu hamwidike. Baho, waluko wake wamuwinza wamlongela, “Mulongele yasegele kwa vija kuchigaza kwa kuguta nyangi!” <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Amala Yesu kawedikila, kalonga “Nhumigwa kwa waja tu wanhu wa Izilaeli weli kama bung'hukilalo wagile welibule wa kuwasusila.” <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Baho iyo mama keza, kamfugamila kalonga, “Mndewa chonde chonde nitaze.” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu kamwidika, “Havinogile kusola ndia ya wana na kuwapigisila umbwa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Iyo mama kedika, “Kweli Mndewa, mbali hata umbwa woja ndia ilagale haja hawaja Wandewa wao.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Baho Yesu kamwidika, “Mama nhogola yako ng'hulu, ivo usang'haniligwe kama vuulonda.” Ija biti yake kahona saa iija.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu kalawa baho kaita umwambu wa lamba da Galilaya, kakwela kulugongo na kakala hasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Bumbila kulu da wanhu dimuwinza Yesu, wanhu wengi ng'hani wamwizila wawagala weli na nhale na vipofu na mbetembete na weli na ludanha na wamwenga wengi wakalile na vitamu, waweka haulongozi mmagulu gake, nayo Yesu kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Bumbila kulu da wanhu wakanganya kuona weli na ludanha wolonga, wakalile waholole wahona na mbetembete wogenda na vipofu woona, wanhu wamtogola Mulungu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'ha ndia wanhu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maluko 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Baho Yesu kawakema waluko wake kalonga, “Nowonela bazi wanhu wano kwa vija wakala na niye mazua madatu, nao sambi wabule ndia isigale. Sitogola kuwaleka wasegele bila kuja, sekewasinduke mnzila. <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Waluko wake wamlongela Yesu, “Hano chamchiwala, chopatahi ndia ya kwenela wanhu wengi vino?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu kawauza,”mna migate mingahi?” Wamwidika, walonga, “Migate saba na visomba vidodo chidogo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Baho, Yesu kawalagiza wanhu wakale hasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Kaisola ija migate na vija visomba, kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu na kamega, kaweng'ha waluko nao wawagolela wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Wose waja weguta. Amala wakunzanya vilagale na wamemeza vigelo saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Wao wadile wakala walume kubita elufu nne, bila kupeta wanachike na wana wadodo. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Baho, Yesu kawalaga wanhu, kakwela ngalawa, kaita uko Magidala.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wolonda uzonza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maluko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Mafalisayo na Masadukayo wamuwinza Yesu, na wamgeza, wampula yawalagusile uzonza kulawa Kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Mbali Yesu kawedika, kawalongela, “Yahavika chigulogulo, mweye molonga, ‘Igolo hokua goya kwa vija wingu dung'hu.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na imitondo molonga, “Lelo hokua na chivumbi cha mvula, kwa vija ulanga mdung'hu na wingu dizama.” Ivo mweye mdaha ng'hani kusoma misimo na kulola Ulanga, mbali kumanya uzonza wa misimo wa Mulungu hamvimanyile! <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Ulelo wa ubananzi na wa luhadu! Cholonda uzonza, mbali haching'higwa uzonza wowose ila uja wa Yona.” Baho kawaleka, kasegela.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amila ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maluko 8:14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Waluko wake viwalokile umwambu wa kaidi mwa lamba, wakala waisemwile kusola migate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu kawalongela, “Muiteganye na amila ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Baho wao wakala woilongela, “Kolonga ivo kwa vija hachisolile migate.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu kavimanya viwailongela, kawauza, “Mweye wanhu kutogola kwenu kudodo! Habali molongelela mbuli ya kuleka kusola migate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Ivo, mng'hali kuvimanya? Ivo muisemwa viniimegile ija migate mitano niwalisa wanhu elufu tano? Ivo mmemeza vigelo vingahi kwa ndia ilagale? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Hebu ija migate saba iniwalisile wanhu elufu nne? Ivo mmemeza vigelo vingahi va ndia isigale? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Habali hamvimanya kua sikalile nolongelela mbuli ya migate? <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Baho waluko wavimanya kawalongela waitiganye na amila ya migate, mbali kwa mbuli ya mafundo ga Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kolonga kua Yesu Mwana wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maluko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu viyavikile ubanzi wa Kaisalia Filipi, kawuza waluko wake, wanhu wolonga Mwana wa Munhu iyo nani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Wamwidika, “Wamwenga wolonga kua iyo Yohana Mbatizi, wamwenga iyo Elia, na wamwenga Yelemia hebu imwe wa waja walagusi wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu kawauza, “Na mweye vilihi molonga niye iyo nani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petulo kamwidika, “Gweye iyo Kilisito Mlohozi, Mwana wa Mulungu uli na ugima.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu kalonga, “Kumweda gweye Simoni mwana Yona, kwa vija habule munhu yoyose yakufunhulile mbuli ino, mbali Tata yangu yeli Kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Na niye nokulongela, “Gweye Petulo, kumwako gweye nodikunzanya bumbila da wanhu wamtogola Kilisito, hebu udaho wa isi ya wafile haidaha kuwahuma. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Nokwing'ha fungulo wa ufaume wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, chila chuufungile muiisi, chofungigwa ivija Kuulanga kwa Mulungu, chila chuufungula muiisi chofunguligwa kuulanga.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Amala kawagoma waluko wake sekewamlongele munhu yoyose kua yeye iyo Kilisito.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya kudununzika na ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Maluko 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:22-27">9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kulawila baho Yesu kasonga kuwalongela waluko wake bila chifiso kua kolondeka kuita Yelusalem, na uko kopata kodununzigwa ng'hani na Wavele na Wakulu wa Walava Nhambiko na Wafunda ndagizi za Musa, kua kokomigwa na mdizua da kadatu kozilibuligwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Baho Petulo kamlava Yesu hamgwazo, kasonga kumkomokeka, “Sekeiwe ivo Mndewa mbuli ino haikuvika!” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Mbali Yesu kahinduka, kamlongela Petulo, “Segela hamwangu, Mwenembago! Gweye kong'imila niye. Kotonga ga wanhu hutonga ga Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Amala Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, “Munhu yoyose yahalonda kua mjalusona wangu, kolondeka yaileme mwenyego, na yatogole msalaba wake amala yaniwinze. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Manake munhu yonda yaulohole ugima wake mwenyego, kowagiza, mbali yonda kuwagiza ugima wake kwa kuniwinza, koupata. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Mbali munhu yonda kwagiza ugima wake kwa mbuli yangu kouhonya. Ivo munhu kopata choni yahapata uzenzi wa isi zose na kuno kawagiza ugima wake? Hebu munhu kolava choni chiwe badili ya ugima wake? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Manake Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza muukulu wa Tata yake hamwe na watumigwa wake wa kwa Mulungu, na baho, baho honda yamlihe chila munhu kwa vija viyasang'hane. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nowalongela kweli, hana wamwenga bahano hawadanganika mbaka wonda wamone Mwana wa Munhu yaheza Muufaume wake.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kogeluka chihanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maluko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Vigabitile mazua sita, Yesu kawasola Petelo, na Yakobo na Yohana na ndugu yake, kaita nao waiyeka kulugongo mtali. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Uko, Yesu kageluka chihanga hamwao, chihanga chake chibalika kama zua na vivalo vake vikala vizelu chuwee kama bung'hulo. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Bahaja waluko wa Yesu wawaona Musa na Elia walawilila wolonga na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Baho Petulo kamlongela Yesu, “Mndewa vinoga cheye kukala hano! Wahalonda nozenga viheha vidatu, chimwe chako na chimwe cha Musa na chimwenga Elia.” <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Viyakalile kolonga ivo, wingu zelu diwagubika, na dizi dihulikika kulawa mdiwingu yolonga, “Ino iyo mwanangu wa wende, nili na wende nayo, mtegelezeni. <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Waluko viwahulike dizi iyo wagwa kingubanguba, wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yesu kawawinza, kawamha kalonga, “Imeni, sekemdumbe!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Viwalolile wamuona Yesu yaiyeka, hakala habule munhu imwenga. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Baho, viwakalile wotelemka kulawa kulugongo, Yesu kawalalika, “Sekemumlongele munhu mbuli mzionile mbaka Mwana wa Munhu vonda yazilibuligwe.” <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Amala waluko wamuuza, “Habali wafunda ndagizi za Musa wolonga kua yolondeka tanhu Elia yeze?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu kawedika, “Kweli, Elia kokwiza kuzitanda goya mbuli zose. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Mbali nowalongeleni, Elia kamala kwiza nao hawammanyile, mbali wamtendela kama viwalondile. Ivo ivo Mwana wa Munhu ivo yatendiligwe mmakono gao.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Baho wao waluko wavimanya kua kakala kowalongela mbuli ya Yohana Mbatizi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya mbwanga yambule chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maluko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Viwauvikile kaidi dija bumbila da wanhu munhu imwe kamuwinza Yesu, kamtumbalila mavindi, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />kalonga, “Mndewa, monele bazi mwanangu kwa vija kana utamu wa kugwa, kaidi kodununzika ng'hani, mala nyingi iyo kogwa mmoto hebu mmazi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nimgala kwa waluko wako mbali wapotigwa kumhonya.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu kedikila, “Mweye ulelo wa ubananzi na ulekile kutogola! Nokala na mweye mbaka lini? Nowafunyila moyo mbaka lini? Ngaleni hano iyo mwana!” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu kamkomokela Mwenembago nayo kamlawa, na ija mbwanga kahona saa iija. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Amala waluko wamuwinza Yesu waiyeka wamuuza, “Habali cheye chipotigwa kumlava ija chinyamkela?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu kawedika, “Kwa mbuli ya nhogola yenu ndodo. Nowalongeleni, kama tu mwahawa na nhogola ilindodo kama mbeyu ya haladali, modaha kuulongela lugongo uno, ‘Lawa hano uite haja,’ nao woita. Baho hahakalile na chinhu chiwapote. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Chinyamkela kama ino havidahika kumlava ila kwa kupula na kufunga!”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga kaidi mbuli ya ifa na uzilibuko wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Waluko viwakalile hamwe uko isi ya Galilaya, Yesu kawalongela, “Mwana wa Munhu womgoga na kugaligwa kwa wanhu <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />na wao womkoma, mbali mdizua da kadatu kozilibuka.” Na waluko wake wogwa giogio ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuliha kodi ya Nga'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Viwavikile Kapelenaumu, wagoga kodi wa ng'anda ya Mulungu waita kwa Petulo, wamuuza, “Ivo, Mfundaji wenu koliha kodi ya ng'anda ya Mulungu?” <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petulo kedika,“Ena, koliha.” Baho, Petulo viyeingile muing'anda, kabula hanalonga mbuli, Yesu kamlongolela kamuuza, “Simoni, gweye koonaze? Wafaume wa mziisi hukunzanya kodi kulawa kwa yelihi? Kulawa kwa wenekae hebu kulawa kwa nyambenyambe?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petulo kedika, “Kulawa kwa nyambenyambe.” Yesu kawalongela,“Ena ivo, wenekae hawaliha. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Mbali kwa vija seke chigombe nao, genda kudilamba ukaloe somba, na umsole somba yasongile kwenzeka, mbalule mlomo wake, na mzinda mwake kovika sente ya kwenela kuliha kodi. Isole kwa mbuli yangu na kwa mbuli yako.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Yelihi yeli Mkulu Muufaume wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Chipindi chija waluko wamuwinza Yesu wamuuza, “Yelihi yeli Mkulu ng'hani Muufaume wa Kuulanga kwa Mulungu?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu kamkema mwana imwe kamwimiza hagati yao, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />amala kalonga,”nomlongeleni kweli, kama hamuhinduke na kua kama wana wadodo, hamdaha mbe kwingila Muufaume wa Kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Yoyose yonyenyekela kama mwana mdodo ino, iyo mkulu kubita wose Muufaume wa Kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Yoyose yombokela mwana mdodo kama ino kwa zina jangu kombokela niye.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngw'alo imtenda munhu yasang'hane malozo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maluko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Yoyose honda yamwagize imwe mwa wano wadodo wonhogola niye, yofaya ng'hani yafungiligwe msingo dibwe kulu da kusagila na kudidimizigwa mmazi mengi Muibahali. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Woluona wanhu wa isi ino, wowatenda wanhu womtogola Kilisito wasang'hane malozo, mbuli zitenda wanhu kusang'hana malozo, mbali kuluona iyo munhu yowatenda wanhu wasang'hane malozo! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Kama mkono hebu mgulu wako wahakuhoza, ukanhe na kuwasa kutali na gweye. Yofaya gweye kwingila Muugima ulibule uhelelo bila mkono hebu mgulu, hebu kwasigwa muumoto uja haufa kuno uhawa na mikono midi na migulu yako midi. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Na siso jako dihakuhonza, ding'ole na kujasa hatali na gweye. Yofaya ng'hani gweye kwingila Muugima ulibule uhelelo uhawa na songo, hebu kwasigwa muumoto uja haufa uhawa na meso gako gose maidi.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulinga mbuli kwa bung'hukilalo yagile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Itiganyeni! Sekemzeleu imwe mwa wano wadodo. Nowalongeleni Watumigwa wao wa kwa Mulungu mala zose weli na Tata yangu yeli Kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Kwa vija Mwana wa Munhu keza kuwalohola waja wokala kama wagile. <verse eid="MAT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Moonaze? Munhu yahawa na bung'hukilalo mia, na yahamwagiza imwe, kotendaze? Kowaleka waja tisini na tisa kulugongo, amala koita kumzabwila ija yagile. <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Yahampata, nowalongeleni kweli, komnonela iyo ng'hani kubita viyawanonela waja tisini na tisa waja hawagile. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Hata ivo Tata yenu yeli Kuulanga halonda hata imwe mwa wano wadodo yage.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtaze munhu yahaloza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Ndugu yako yahakusovula, genda kamlongele usovu wake mwahawa muiyeka. Yahakutegeleza mokua muilumba na iyo ndugu. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Yahalema kukutegeleza, sola munhu imwe hebu waidi hamwe na gweye, manake mbuli ihaloligwa na wanhu waidi hebu wadatu, chila mbuli ilongigwa yokala goya. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Yahalema kuwategeleza bumbila da wanhu womtogola Kilisito, na kama hategeleza bumbila da wanhu womtogola Kilisito, na yawe kumwako kama mhazi na mgoga kodi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kufunga na Kufungula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Nowalongeleni kweli, chimfunga muuisi chofungigwa Kuulanga kwa Mulungu, na chomfungula muuisi chofunguligwa Kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Kaidi nowalongeleni, waidi mmwenu wahaitogolela hano muuisi kwa mbuli yoyose yumpula, Tata yangu wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kowasang'hanila ivo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kwa vija hohose haja waidi wahaiting'hanila kwa mbuli yangu, niye na hamwe nao.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulinga mbuli kwa mtumigwa ija hogela kumgongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Amala Petulo kamuwinza Yesu kamuuza, “Ivo, ndugu yangu yahanisovula nigele kumgongo mala nyingahi? Ivo, mala saba?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu kamwidikila kamulongela, “Silonga mala saba tu, mbali sabini mala saba. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Ndiyo mana ufaume wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu uilinga na mfaume imwe kalawa kuita kulola hisabu za watumigwa wake. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Viyasongile kupeta, kagaligwa munhu imwe yakalile yodaigwa chiasi cha sente mimilioni mingi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Munhu iyo hakalile na chinhu cha kuliha, ivo mfaume wake kalagiza yaguligwe yeye na mwehe wake na wanage na vose yeli navo ili kuliha choyodaigwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Baho ija mtumigwa kamtumbalila mavindi kalonga, ‘Nokupula unionele bazi nokuliha deni jako.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Ija mfaume kamonela bazi, na kamlekela deni jake kamleka yasegele. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Mbali ija mtumigwa kasegela, kamvika imwe mwa watumigwa wayage yakalile na deni da sente chidogo. Kamgoga kamfida, ‘Liha deni jangu!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Iyo mtumigwa miyage kamtumbalila mavindi kampula, ‘Unionele bazi nokuliha.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Mbali yeye halondile kugela kumgongo, ila kamgala muing'anda yakufungila wanhu mbaka baho honda yamlihe dija deni. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ivo watumigwa wayage viwaonile mbuli ino wagevuzika ng'hani na waita kumlongela mndewa wao mbuli ija ilawilile. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Baho ija mfaume kamkema mtumigwa iyo kamlongela, ‘Gweye mtumigwa wihile ng'hani! Kunipula na niye nigela kumgongo deni jako jose. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ivo, haulondeke kumonela bazi mtumigwa miyago kama vinikuonele bazi?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Baho, iyo mfaume kagevuzika ng'hani kamsola ija mtumigwa, kamgala muing'anda yakufungila wanhu wamdununze mbaka hondayalihe deni jose.” <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yesu kakomeleza kwa kulonga, “Vino ivo Tata yangu yeli Kuulanga kwa Mulungu vonda yawatendele kama na mweye homgela kumgongo waja muwadai.<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Mafundo kwambuli ya Nyasa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maluko 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu viyakomeleze kulonga mbuli izo, kahalawa Galilaya kaita muiisi ya Yudea, umwambu mwa Lwanda lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Wanhu wengi wamuwinza uko nayo kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wamuwinza, wamuuza kwa kumgeza, “Ivo yofaa mulume kumwasa mwehe wake kwa mbuli yoyose ija?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu kawedika kawalongela, “Ivo hamsomile mayandiko ga Mulungu kua Mulungu viyamulumbile munhu baho umwaka kamulumba mulume na muke? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Kalonga, ‘Kwambuli iyo mulume komleka tata yake na mami yake, kuilumba na mwehe wake, nao waidi wokua lukuli lumwe?’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Kwa ivo, wao sio waidi mbali lukuli lumwe. Ivo chiyalumbile Mulungu, munhu sekeyawagole.” <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Mbali wao wamuuza, “Ivo habali Musa kachilagiza muke yeng'higwe balua ya nyasa na yalekigwe?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu kawedika, “Musa kaweng'ha chibali cha kuwasa wehe zenu kwa mbuli udala wa mioyo yenu, mbali haikalile ivo baho haichanduso. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Ivo nowalongeleni, yeye yomwasa mwehe wake kwambuli imwenga yoyose ija ila kwa mbuli ya ugoni, yahasola mwehe imwenga kotenda ugoni.” <verse eid="MAT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Waluko wake wamlongela, “Yahawa mbuli za mulume na mwehe ivo zili, yofaya kuleka kusola.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu kawalongela, “Sio wose wodaha kutogola hala dino, ila tu waja weng'higwe mbuli iyo na Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kwa vija hana mbuli nyingi za kuleka kusola. Wamwenga kwavija waleligwa wabule nguvu za chilume, na wamwenga kwa vija watendigwa ivo na wanhu, na wamwenga walamula kuleka kusola kwa mbuli ya ufaume wa Mulungu. Yodaha kutogola fundo dino na atende ivo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapulila ganogile kwa Mulungu wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Amala wanhu wamgalila Yesu wana wadodo ila yawekile mikono na kuwapulila. Mbali waluko wawakimila. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu kalonga, “Walekeni wao wana weze kumwangu hebu sekemuwakimile, manake ufaume wa Kuulanga kwa Mulungu ni wa wanhu weli kama wana wano.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ivo Yesu kawapulila ganogile ga Mulungu, amala kasegela hanu haja.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwanga mzenzi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Munhu imwe mzenzi kamuwinza Yesu kamuuza, “Mfundaji, nh'ende choni chinogile ili mhate ugima ulibule uhelelo?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu kamlongela, “Habali koniuza kwa mbuli ya dinogile? Hana munhu imwe tu yanogile. Wahalonda kwingila muugima ulibule uhelelo goga ndagizi za Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Ija mbwanga mzenzi kamuuza, “Ndagizi zilihi?” Yesu kalonga, “Sekeukome, Sekeutende ugoni, Sekewibe, Seke ulonge uvwizi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Wategeleze tata yako na mami yako na mwing'he wende miyago kama vuuwigesa mwenyego.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Ija mbwanga kamlongela, “Gago gose nigagoga, nh'ende choni chimwenga?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu kamlongela, “Kama uhalonda kutogoligwa ng'hani na Mulungu, genda ukagule vinhu vako uweng'he vikumbi muyega sente izo, na gweye kokua na usigavu Kuulanga kwa Mulungu amala izo uniwinze.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Mbwanga iyo viyahulike gago, kasegela yeli na giogio, kwa vija kakala na uzenzi mkulu ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Baho Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, “Nowalongeleni kweli yokua vidala ng'hani kwa mzenzi kwingila muu Ufaume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Kaidi nowalongeleni, ibuha ng'hani kwa mnyama ngamia kwingila mdizonzo da sindano, kubita mzenzi kwingila muufaume wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Waluko waja viwahulike ivo, wakanganya ng'hani, wamuuza, “Ivo yelihi yodaha kuloholigwa?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu kawalola kalonga, “Kwa wanhu mbuli ino haidahika, mbali kwa Mulungu mbuli zose zodahika.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Amala Petulo kalonga, “Na cheye vilihi? Chileka vose chikuwinza, ivo chopata choni?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli, Mwana wa Munhu yahakala mchigoda chake cha ufaume muukulu wa isi ya sambi, mweye moniwinza na kukala mvigoda kumi na vidi mogalamula makabila kumi na maidi ga Izilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Na chila yalekila ng'anda hebu ndugu hebu lumbu hebu tata hebu mama hebu wana hebu migunda, kwa mbuli yangu kobokela mala mia na kubita, na kubokela ugima ulibule uhelelo. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Mbali walongole wokua wa chikomelezo na wachikomelezo wolongola.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Wasang'hanaji mumgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Ufaume wa Kuulanga uilinga na munhu yeli na mgunda wa mizabibu, yalawile yaidawile imitondo kwa mbuli ya kuweng'ha chibabalua wasang'hanaji mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Kaitogolela nao kuweng'ha chila munhu sente ya maliho ga zua dimwe, amala kawagala mumgunda wake wa mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Kalawa chipindi cha saa nhatu imitondo, kawaona wanhu wamwenga wema mdigulilo bila sang'hano. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Kawalongela, ‘Na mweye gendeni mkasang'hane mumgunda wangu wa mizabibu, na niye nowaliheni chimlondeka kubokela.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Ivo, waita. Iyo mwene mgunda kalawa kaidi mchipindi cha saa sita na saa tisa, katenda ivija. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Hata chipindi cha saa kumi na moja chigulogulo, kalawa kaidi, kawavika wanhu wamwenga wema mdigulilo. Ivo kawauza, ‘Habali mwima hano misi yose bila sang'hano?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Wamwidika, ‘kwavija habule munhu yaching'ile chibalua.’ Nayo kawalongela, ‘Na mweye gendeni mkasang'hane sang'hano mumgunda wangu wa mizabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Viivikile chigulogulo, iyo mwene mgunda kamlongela mgoga sente wake, ‘Wakeme vibalua uwalihe chitumetume chao, uhasongela kwa waja wezile hachisogo, na kukomelezela waja walongole.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Ivo weza waja weng'higwe chibalua saa kumi na moja, chila munhu kabokela sente ya maliho ga zua dimwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Waja wa walongole viwavikile wakala wagize wobokela hakulu, mbali hata wao weng'higwa chila imwe sente ya maliho ga zua dimwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Wazibokela sente izo, wasonga kumnung'hunikila ija mwene mgunda. Ivo wamlongela, huchitendele goya. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Walonga, ‘Wanhu wano weng'higwe chibalua haichikomelezo wasang'hana sang'hano kwa saa dimwe tu, habali kuchiliha sawa na wao kuno cheye chifunya moyo kwa kusang'hana sang'hano ndala imisi na zua kali?’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Baho ija mwene mgunda kamwidika munhu imwe mmwao, ‘Mbwiga sikubunzile chinhu! Ivo, hachiitogolele chitumetume cha sente ya maliho ga zua dimwe? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Sola chuulondeka kwing'higwa, usegele. Nolonda kumwing'ha ino wa ichikomelezo kuilinga na gweye. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Ivo, silondeka kusang'hana jojose dinilonda na sente zangu nilinazo? Ivo, koona maya kwa vija vinh'endile goya.’”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Haichikomelezo Yesu kalonga, “Ivo, wachikomelezo wolongola na walongole wokua hachisogo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mala ya kadatu kwa mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu viyakalile yokwela kuita Yelusalem kawasola waja waluko wake kumi na waidi hamgwazo waiyeka, na mnzila kawalongela, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Tegelezeni! Choita Yelusalemu na uko Mwana wa Munhu kolavigwa kwa wakulu wa walava nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi za Musa, nao womlamula yakomigwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Womlava kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi ili yakomigwe kwa kuwambigwa mumsalaba, mbali mdizua da kadatu kozibuliligwa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mami yao Yakobo na Yohana kowapulila mbuli wanage</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maluko 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Baho mama yao wana wa Zebedayo kamuinza Yesu hamwe na wanage, kamtumbalila mavindi na kumpula chinhu. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu kamuuza, “Choni chuulonda?” Iyo mama kamlongela, “Nilalike kua muufaume wako wano wanangu waidi wokala imwe ubanzi wako wa kulume na imwenga ubanzi wako wa kumoso.” <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu kadika, “Hamkimanya chimpula. Ivo, modaha kung'wila chikombe cha madununzo kama chinilonda kuching'wila nie?” Wamwidika, “Chodaha.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu kawalongela, “Kweli modaha kuking'wela chikombe changu, mbali kukala kulume hebu kumoso kumwangu sio sang'hano yangu, mbuli iyo wokwing'higwa waja wamalile kutandiligwa na Tata yangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Waja waluko wamwenga kumi viwahulike gago, wawagevuzikila wao ndugu waidi. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Ivo, Yesu kawakema, kawalongela, “Movimanya kua wolongoza muiisi wolongoza wanhu wao kwa ludabwa, na wakulu hao wowatenda viwalonda wanhu wao. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Mbali kumwenu seke iwe ivo, ila yolonda yawe mkulu mmwenu, kolondeka yawasang'hanile wayage, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />na yolonda yawe mlongozi kumwenu kolondeka yamsang'hanileni.<verse eid="MAT 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Kama vija, Mwana wa Munhu hezile kusang'haniligwa mbali kuwasang'hanila na kulava ugima wake kuwa lihilo da ya ulohozi kwa wanhu wengi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya vipofu waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu na waluko wake viwakalile yosegela muikae ya Yeliko, bumbila da wanhu dimuwinza. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ivo, hakala na vipofu waidi mumgwazo wa nzila, na viwahulike Yesu kobita baho, wenula dizi, wakema “Mndewa, mwana Daudi, chionele bazi!” <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Waja wanhu wengi, wawakomokela na kuwalongela wanyamale. Mbali wao waiyoha kwinula dizi, “Mndewa, Mwana Daudi chionele bazi!” <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu kema, kawakema na kuwauza, “Molonda niwasang'hanile choni?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Vipofu waja wamwidika, “Mndewa chokupula meso getu gaone.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Ivo, Yesu kawaonela bazi, na kuwamha meso gao na bahaja wadaha kuona, nao wamuwinza.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalem kwa galigali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu na waluko wake viwavikile habehi na Yelusalemu na wavika mchijiji cha Betifage mchigongo cha Mizeituni, kawalagiza waluko wake waidi, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />kawalongela, “Gendeni mbaka chijiji chili kuulongozi lenu na momvika mhunda kafungigwa hamwe na mwanage. Wafunguleni na mngalile. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Kama munhu yahawauza habali motenda ivo mulongeleni, ‘Mndewa kowalonda, nayo bahaja kowalekeseleni.” <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Mbuli ino itendeka ili gaja galongigwe na mlagusi wa Mulungu gavikile,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Walongeleni wanhu wa kae ya Yelusalemu, iyo Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Lola mfaume wako kokwiza!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Muhole na kapapigwa na mhunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Mwana mhunda, mwanage mhunda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ivo, waja waluko waita na wasang'hana ivija kama Yesu viyawalagize. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Wamgala ija mhunda na mwanage, wayazanza vivalo vao mumgongo mwa waja mhunda na Yesu kakwela nchanha mwa mwana mhunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Bumbila kulu da wanhu wayazanza vivalo vao mnzila, na wanhu wamwenga wakanha vikwamvi va mibiki wayazanza mnzila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Mabumbila ga wanhu walongole na wa hachisogo yake wenula dizi walonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">“Yatogoligwe Mwana wa Daudi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Yeng'higwe ganogile na Mulungu yokwiza kwa Zina da Mndewa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Nhogolwa uchanha kwa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu viyakalile yokwingila Yelusalemu, kae yose imema yugwayugwa wakala wouza, “Ino nani?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Wanhu wa mdibumbila dija walonga, “Ino mlagusi wa Mulungu Yesu kulawa muikae ya Nazaleti isi ya Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowawinga wagulaji Haing'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Baho Yesu kengila Haing'anda ya Mulungu, kawawinga wanhu wakalile wogula vinhu Haiing'anda ya Mulungu, kazihindula meza zao waja wanhu wakalile wogula na kubadili sente, na kahindula vigoda va waja wakalile wogula njiwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Kawalongela, “Yandikigwa mgayamayandiko ga Mulungu, ‘Ng'anda yangu yokemigwa ng'anda ya kupula.’ Mbali mweye muitenda kua mhango ya wabavi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Vipofu na weli na nhale wamwenga wamuwinza uko Haing'anda ya Mulungu nayo Yesu kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Baho wakulu wa Walava nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi za Musa viwaonile mbuli za uzonza uyasang'hane Yesu, na ivija waja wana wakalile woguta nyangi zao Haing'anda ya Mulungu walonga, “Yatogoligwe Mwana wa Daudi,” Wao wagevuzika. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Baho, wamlongela Yesu, “Ivo huhulika chowalonga wana wadodo?” Yesu kawedika,“Enaa, nohulika! Ivo, hamsomile mayandiko gano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">‘Kwa milomo ya wana wadodo na ving'hele wokwing'ha nhogolwa gweye.’”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Baho kawaleka, kalawa hanze Haikae ya Mulungu na kuita kukijiji cha Betania, kawasa uko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowinukila mbiki wa ng'huyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maluko 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Yesu viyakalile yobwela muikae ya Yelusalemu mnzila kulawa Betania, lukwili kaona nzala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Kauona mbiki wa ng'huyu hamgwazo ya nzila, kauwinza, mbali kauvika wabule chinhu ila mayani muhala. Baho kawinukila kaulongela, “Seke ulele manhunda ng'oo!” Bahaja uja mbiki wa ng'huyu unyala. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Waluko wake viwaonile gago wakanganya walonga, “Habali mbiki uno wa ng'huyu unyala gafula?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu kawedikila, ‘“Nowalongeleni kweli, kama mwahawa na nhogola na bila kudumba, modaha sio kutenda ivo tu, mbali hata mhaulongela lugongo luno “Somoka ukasigwe muibahali,’ yotendeka ivo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Na mwahawa na nhogola chochose chimpula kwa kufugama, mokwing'higwa.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kouzigwa mbuli ya ukulu wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu viyabwelile kaidi kui ng'anda ya Mulungu, kakala yofunda. Viyakalile yofunda, wakulu wa walava nhambiko na wavele wa wanhu wamuuza, “Kosang'hana mbuli zino kwa udaho gani? Yelihi yakudahize gano?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu kawedika, “Nanie nomuuzani mbuli imwe, muhanidika nanie nomlongeleni nosang'hana mbuli zino kwa udaho gani. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Ivo, udaho wa kubatiza wa Yohana Mbatizi ulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu hebu kwa wanhu?” Mbali wailongela wao kwa wao vino, “Chahalonga, ‘Ulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu,’ kochiuza, ‘Ivo mbona hamumtogole Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Na chihalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wanhu,’ chodumba bumbila da wanhu vonda wachitende, manake wose wotogola kua Yohana kakala mlagusi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Baho wamlongela Yesu, “Hachimanyile!” Nayo Yesu kawalongela, “Nanie siwalongela nosang'hana gano kwa udaho gani.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa wabwanga waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Mweye moonaze, munhu imwe kakala na wabwanga waidi. Kamlongela ija imkulu, ‘Mwanangu, lelo genda ukasang'hane sang'hano kumgunda wa mizabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Ija mwabwanga mkulu kamlongela, ‘Ndema!’ Mbali amala kahinduka, kaita kusang'hana sang'hano. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Amala tata ija kamlongela mwanage wa kaidi ivija, nayo kamwidika, ‘Enaa tata! Mbali haitile kuisang'hano. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ivo, yelihi kati ya wano waidi yatendile chiyalondile tataake?” Wamwidika, “Ija mwana yalongole.” Ivo, Yesu kawalongela, “Nomlongeleni kweli, wagoga kodi na weli na luhadu wokwingila muufaume wa Mulungu kabula yenu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Manake Yohana Mbatizi keza kumwenu na kawalagusila nzila itogoligwe kukala na Mulungu, na mweye hamumtogole, mbali wagoga kodi na weli na luhadu wamtogola. Vimuonile gago gose mweye mng'hali hamtogole na kugaleka malozo genu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa walimi na mgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu kalonga, “Tegelezeni mfano umwenga. Hakala na mwene mgunda imwe kalima mgunda wa mizabibu, kauzungulusila lwigo, amala kahimba hanhu hakukamila zabibu, na ivija kazenga lingo da kwamilila umo mumgunda. Amala kawadodisha walimi nayo kapata mwanza wa kuita isi ya kutali.<verse eid="MAT 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Mumsimu wa mulao vuuvikile, kawalagiza watumigwa wake kwa waja walimi wakodishigwe mgunda, ili wamwing'he fungu jake mwa zija zabibu ziwahulule. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Waja wakodile mgunda wawakwida waja watumigwa wa mwene mgunda, imwe wamtoa, imwenga wamkoma na imwenga wamtoa mabwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Iyo mwene mgunda kawalagiza watumigwa wamwenga, wengi kubita waja walongole. Waja wakodile mgunda wawatendela ivija na wano. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Mchikomelezo kamlagiza mwanage kuno kotonga kua, ‘Womgesa mwanangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Mbali waja walimi viwamuonile ija mwanage wailongela wenyego kwa wenyego, Ino iyo muhazi, na chimkome ili chiusole uhazi wake!” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ivo, wamvamila na kumkwida, wamlava kunze mwa mgunda uja wa mizabibu, wamkoma. <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />“Ivo, iyo mwene mgunda wa mizabibu yaheza, kowatendaze wao walimi?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Wao wamwidika, “Kowakoma vihile wao wabananzi, na uja mgunda koweng'ha walimi wamwenga wao weonda wamwing'he fungu jake viilondeka.<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Baho Yesu kawalongela, “Ivo hamsomile mbuli ino mgamayandiko ga Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Dibwe diwalemile wazenzi kama hadifaya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Diwa dibwe kulu da kutumanila ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Dino ijo diyatendile Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Najo diwa da kuchikanganya!<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Kwaivo nowalongeleni, ufaume wa Mulungu wosegezigwa hamwenu na kwing'higwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga waja wondawasang'hane gaja goyolonda Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Yogwa mdibwe dino kobeneka vihande na dihamgwila munhu yoyose, domhonda honda.” <verse eid="MAT 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Wakulu wa walava nhambiko na Mafalisayo viwahulike iyo mifano yake wavimanya kua kakala yowalonga wao. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Kwaivo wakala wolonda nzila ya kumwamha, mbali wawadumba wanhu kwavija wanhu wavimanya kua Yesu mlagusi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Mfano wa ndia ya lusona lwa zengele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga nao kwa mifano, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Ufaume wa kuulanga uilinga na mfaume imwe yamsang'hanile mbwangaake ndia ya lusona lwa zengele. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Kawalagiza watumigwa wake wakawakeme wagonekigwe mulusona lwa zengele, mbali wagonekigwe hawalondile kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Ivo, kawalagiza watumigwa wamwenga, kawalongela, ‘Walongeleni waja wagonekigwe, ‘Lusona lwa zengele jangu sambi da tiyali, ming'ombe yangu milume na magung'hundila wanonile wachinjigwa mwaka, vinhu vose va tiali, izoni mulusona.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Mbali wao hawagesile, wasegela, imwe kaita kumgunda wake, imwenga kaita kuzisang'hano zake, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />na wamwenga wawamha waja watumigwa na wawatoa na wawakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Ija mfalume kagevuzika ng'hani, kawalagiza wamilizi wake wakawakome wao wakomile wayao na kuwasomela kae yao. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Labaho kawalongela watumigwa wake, ‘Ndia ya lusona lwa zengele imala kwipa, mbali wagonekigwe hawalondeke kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Sambi gendeni mzinzila mhanda heli na wanhu wengi muikae na mkawagoneke wanhu muindia ya zengele wanhu wose wonda muwaone. <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Waja watumigwa walawa, waita mzinzila za kae zili na wanhu wengi, wawakunzanya wanhu wose, wehile na wanogile. Luhelengo lwa zengele lumema nyambenyambe.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Baho mfalume viyengile kuwaona wagonekigwe, kamuona munhu imwe havalile chivalo cha zengele. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Mfaume kamuuza, ‘Mbwiga, kwingilaze muno bila kuvala chivalo cha lusona lwa zengele? Mbali iyo munhu kakala hupi. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Baho mfaume kawalongela watumigwa, ‘Mgeleni nzabi mikono na magulu, mkamwase kunze kudiziza, uko yalile na kuluma meno.’” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yesu kakomeleza kwakulonga, “Wagonekigwa ni wengi, mbali wasaguligwa wadodo.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kouzigwa mbuli ya kuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Amala Mafalisayo wasegela, wamwikila chigwena vija vonda wamwamhe Yesu kwa ulonzi wake. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ivo wawatuma wajalusona wao hamwe na wajalusona wa Helode. Wamuuza, “Mfundaji, chivimanya kua gweye kwa munhu utogoligwa, humdumba munhu yoyose, manake ukulu wa munhu si chochose kumwako. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Ivo chilongele vuuona. Ivo, cheye yofaya kumliha kodi Mkulu wa Loma hebu haifaya?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Mbali Yesu kavimanya viwotonga vihile kawalongela, “Mweye watenda giladi mbona monigeza? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Ndagusileni iyo sente yakulihila kodi!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:19">Wamwing'ha iyo sente, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />nayo Yesu kawauza wao, chihanga chino na zina dino da nani?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Wamwidika, “Da mkulu wa Loma.” Baho Yesu kawalongela, “Mwing'heni gake mkulu wa Loma, na ga Mulungu mwing'heni Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Viwahulike ivo wakanganya ng'hani, wamleka, wasegela.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masadukayo womuuza Yesu mbuli ya kuzilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Mdizua ijo, Masadukayo wamwenga waja hawatogola kuzilibuka kwa wafile wamuinza Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Ivo, wamlongela, “Mfundaji, Musa kalonga munhu yasolile mwehe yahafa bila kuleka wana, kolondeka magati yamhazi mwehe iyo mgane, ili yamlelele wana mkulu wake. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Ivo, hano hamwetu hakala na ndugu saba waleligwe na tata imwe. Yalongole kasola amala kadanganika bila kulela wana, mdodowake kamhazi iyo mgane. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Mbuli iyo imlawila iyo ndugu wa kaidi na wakadatu mbaka wose saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Viwamalile ndugu wose kudanganika, na mgane ija kadanganika ivija. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Ivo, mdizua dakuzilibuka wafile mgane iyo kokua mwehe wa yelihi mwa waja ndugu saba? Manake wose saba wakala wamsola.” <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu kewedika waja Masadukayo, “Mweye mokwaga kwavija hammanyile Mayandiko ga Mulungu hebu udaho wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Manake wafile wahazilibuka habule kusola hebu kusoligwa, wokua kama watumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Mbali kwa mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa wafile, ivo hamsomile gaja gayawalongele Mulungu? Kawalonge, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Nie Mulungu wa Ibulahimu na Mulungu wa Isaka na Mulungu wa Yakobo.’ Ivo, Mulungu sio Mulungu wa wanhu wafile mbali ni Mulungu wa wanhu wagima.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Bumbila da wanhu viwahulike ivo, wakanganya kwa vija viyofunda.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndagizi ng'hulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maluko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Mafalisayo viwahulike kua Yesu kawatenda Mafalisayo wapotigwe na dakulonga, waigoneka kuiting'hanila hamwe, <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Mfunda ndagizi za Musa imwe mmwao, kamuuza Yesu kwa kumgeza, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Mfundaji, ilihi ndagizi ili ng'hulu mzindagizi zose?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu kamwidika,” ‘Mwing'he wende Mndewa Mulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose na kwa muhe wako wose na kwa ubala wako wose.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ino iyo ndagizi ng'hulu na ya mosi. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Na yakaidi iilinga na iyo, ‘Mwing'he wende miago kama vuuing'ha mwenyego. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Ndagizi zose za Musa na mafundo gose ga walagusi wa Mulungu zogangamiza mzindagizi zino mbili.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowauza Mafalisayo Kilisito ni nani?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Mafalisayo viwamalle kuiting'hana hamwe Yesu kawauza, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Mweye moonaze kwambuli ya Kilisito? Ivo, mwana nani?” Wamwidika, “Mwana Daudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ivo, yodahikaze kua kwa udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu Daudi komkema iyo Mndewa? Iyo mana kalonga,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Mndewa Mulungu kamlongela Mndewa wangu. Kala mkono wangu wa kulume, mbaka honda uwahume kabisa wahasanyi wako.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Ivo, yahawa Daudi komkema Kristo ‘Mndewa,’ kodahaze kaidi kua mwanage?” <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Habule munhu yoyose yadahile kumwidika mbuli. Na kulawa zua ijo habule munhu yagezile kaidi kumuuza mbuli.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalakila wafunda ndagizi na Mafalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38">Maluko 12:38</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luka 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45">20:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 20:46">46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Amala Yesu kadilongela bumbila da wanhu na waluko wake. <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />Wafunda ndagizi za Musa wao wana udaho wa kufambula ndagizi za Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Kwaivo gogeni na kusang'hana jojose donda wawalongeleni. Mbali seke muwawinze ziwotenda kwavija hawosang'hana gaja gowawalongela mweye. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Wao wofunga mbahasha zizamile na wowapika wanhu mmayega, mbali wao wenyego hawalonda kuwataza hata chidogo. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Wao wosang'hana mbuli zao ili wanhu wawaone. Wovala vihande va mbende mvihanga vao na mmakono vili na mayandiko ga ndagizi na wokunza mhindo nhali mmakoti gao. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Wolonda nyafasi za nhogolwa mzisona na vigoda va haulongozi Mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />wolonda kulamusigwa kwa nhogolwa hawaikunzanya wanhu wengi na kulonda kukemigwa na wanhu, ‘Labi.’<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Mbali mweye hamlondeka kukemkemigwa “Labi,” Kwavija mweye mose mwa wajalusona wangu na mfundaji wenu imwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Hebu seke mumkeme munhu yoyose hano muiisi ‘Tata,’ kwavija munayo Tata imwe tu kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Na sekemkemigwe ‘Vilongozi’ manake chilongozi wenu imwe iyo Kilisito. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Yeli mkulu kumwenu kolondeka yawe mtumwa wenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Yoitenda mkulu kotelemsigwa, na yoitenda mdodo kokwinuligwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalakila watenda giladi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maluko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Moluona wafunda ndagizi na Mafalisayo, watendagiladi! Muwakimila wanhu kwingila muufaume wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Mbali mweye wenyego hamwingila mng'anda, na hamlonda kuweng'ha nyafasi ya kwingila waja wolonda kwingila muufaume uo. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Moluona wafunda ndagizi na Mafalisayo, watendagiladi! Muwaonela wagane kwa kuwasolela vinhu vao na kuilagusa kua mnoga kwa kupula Mulungu kwa chipindi chitali. Kwaivo mokwinukiligwa hakulu. <verse eid="MAT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Moluona mweye wafunda ndagizi na Mafalisayo, mtendagiladi! Mohunganika mwibahali na muiisi ili mumpate munhu imwe yawinze nzila yenu. Na mwahampata momwagiza ng'hani na momtenda yasonge kwingila jehanamu kubita mweye wenyego. <verse eid="MAT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Moluona walongozaji vipofu! Mweye molonga munhu yahailahila kwa ng'anda ya Mulungu, kulahila kwake iyo si chinhu, mbali yahailahila kwa zahabu ya ng'anda ya Mulungu kuilahila uko komwamha.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Mweye vipofu wabozi! Dilihi dofaya ng'hani. Zahabu hebu ng'anda ya Mulungu iitenda zahabu kua ya Mulungu?<verse eid="MAT 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Kaidi molonga munhu yayahailahila kwa chilemela si mbuli, mbali yaha ilahila kwa chija chikigwe hachanha hachilemela chakulavila nhambiko, lahilo ijo domwamha. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Mweye vipofu! Chilihi chifaya ng'hani. Dija gweko hebu chilemela chitenda ijo gweko kua nang'hana? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Yoilahila kwa chilemela koilahila kwa icho chilemela, na kwa chochose chikigwe baho, <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Na yoilahila kwa ng'anda ya Mulungu koilahila kwaiyo ng'anda ya Mulungu na kwaija Mulungu yokala umo mng'anda, <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Nayo yoilahila kwa ulanga kwa Mulungu koilahila mchigoda cha ulongozi wa Mulungu na kwaiyo Mulungu yakalile mchigoda icho. <verse eid="MAT 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Moluona mweye wafunda ndagizi na Mafalisayo, watendagiladi! Mowalihiza wanhu fungu dimwe mmafungu kumi ya vitu vidogo kama mbegu za mboga za mayani, binzali na ufuta, na kuno moleka mbuli zifaya za ndagizi kama vija, kutenda mbuli zitogoligwa na Mulungu na kua na bazi na kua na nhogola na kutogoligwa na Mulungu. Gano iyo galondeka kugamha bila kuisemwa gaja gamwenga. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Vilongozi vipofu! Movabula ng'ozi kulawa chimng'wa, mbali momela kihongwe! <verse eid="MAT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Moluona wafunda ndagizi za Musa na Mafalisayo mweye watendagiladi! Mosunha vikombe na bakuli kwa kunze, mbali mgati mleka kumema vinhu vumpatile kwa ubokaji na ugila. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Mfalisayo chipofu! Tanhu chisunhe chikombe mgati na kunze kobung'huka ivija. <verse eid="MAT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Moluona wafunda ndagizi za Musa na Mafalisayo mweye watendagiladi! Mkala kama makabuli gabakigwe chokaa gaja kwa kunze gooneka ganoga, mbali mgati imema mivuha ya mitufi na usisa wa chila aina. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Ivija na mwenye mokoneka na wanhu kwa kunze mnoga, mbali mgati mmema giladi na malozo.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulamuligwa kokwiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Moluona wafunda ndagizi za Musa na Mafalisayo, watendagiladi! Mozenga mapanga ga Walagusi wa Mulungu na kugahamba goya mapanga ga wanhu wanogile. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Na molonga, ‘Kama cheye chahakalile muugima wa wavyele wetu chihalekile kuilumba nao kuwakoma Walagusi wa Mulungu! <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ivo mogangamiza mweye wenyego kua, mweye mwana wa wanhu wawakomile Walagusi. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Ena, komelezeni sang'hano ija wavele zenu waisongile! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Mweye ulelo wa nyoka yeli na sumu! Modahaze kuubanga ulamuzi uja wa moto wa mazua gose galibule uhelelo? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Iyo mana niye nowagalila walagusi wa Mulungu, wanhu weli na nzewele na ilimu, mowakoma na wamwenga kuwawamba mumsalaba, na wamwenga mowalibula viboko Mnzing'anda za kuiting'hanila Wahayudi na kuwazambwila mzikae. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ivo molamuligwa kwa mbuli ya kuwakoma wanhu wose wanogile muuisi mweye na wasaho zenu. Enaa, kulawa kukomigwa kwa Abeli yakalile kabule dihile, mbaka ija ya Zakalia mwana wa Balikia, ija mumkomile Muing'anda ya Mulungu kati ya hanang'hane na chilemela. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nowalongela kweli, ulelo uno wolamuligwa kwa mbuli zino.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kana wende na kae ya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34">Luka 13:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:35">35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Yelusalemu! Gweye Yusalemu! Kowakoma walagusi wa Mulungu na kuwatoa mabwe waja watumigwe kumwako. Mala nyingahi nigeza kuwakunzanya wanago kumwangu, kama vija nguku vookunza vinzia mzimbawa zake, mbali kulema. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Ivo, kae yako yolekigwa uchiwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Nokulongela, honda mnione kaidi mbaka wahalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 23:39">‘Yeng'higwe ganogile ga Mulungu iyo yokwiza kwa zina da Mndewa.’”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kolongelela mbuli ya kubanangigwa ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1">Maluko 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luka 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu kalawa Kuing'anda ya Mulungu, viyakalile yoita, waluko wake wamuwinza, wasonga kulonga nayo mbuli ya ng'anda ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu kawalongela, “Vinoga, modaha kugalonga gano gose! Nowalongela kweli, habule hata dibwe dimwe donda disigale uchanha ya dimwenga, chila chinhu chobomoligwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya na Madununzo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu viyakalile kakala kulugongo lwa Mizeituni, waluko wake wamuwinza mchifiso, wamuuza, “Chilongele mbuli zino zolawilila lini? Vilaguso gani cholagusa kwiza kumwako na msimo wa uhelelo.?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu kawedikila, “Itinganyeni sekemviziligwe na munhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Manake wanhu wengi wolawilla woilonga iyo Kilisito nao wowagiza wanhu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Mohulika mbuli ya bung'hukila na nongelela ya bung'hukila, mbali sekemgwe fufunhende, manake gago gose golondeka kulawilila, mbali uhelelo ung'hali kuvika. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Wanhu wa isi imwe wolawa kuitowa na wanhu wa isi imwenga, wanhu wa ufaume umwe woitowa na wanhu wa ufaume umwenga. Hata hano na haja hokua na nzala na migudemo ya isi. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Gose gago kama chanduso cha usungu wa kuibasula mwana. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Amala mogogigwa na kudununzigwa na wamwenga wenu kukomigwa. Wanhu wa isi zose wowehileni kwavija mweye mnhogola nie. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Kaidi mchipindi icho wanhu wengi wakalile wonitogola woileka kunhogola, wohindukana na kuihila. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Wolawilila walagusi wengi wa uvwizi wonda wawagize wanhu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kwa mbuli za kongezeka kwa ubananzi, wendo da wanhu wengi woholola. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Mbali yofunya moyo mbaka hauelelo iyo yonda yaloholigwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Mbali kabula ya uhelelo kuvika, uno Usenga Unogile wa ufaume wa Mulungu woliguligwa mziisi zose ili wanhu wose wahulike usenga wa Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zua da gayo kulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maluko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Ivo mwahaona, ‘Chinhu chihile chigala ubananzi cha Muing'anda ya Mulungu kama viyalongile Danieli mlagusi wa Mulungu, yonda yasome yaimanye mbuli iyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />“Baho weli uko isi ya Yudea wakimbilile kulugongo. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Yeli kunze seke yengile mng'anda kusola chinhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Yeli kumgunda seke yabwele ukae kusola valo jake. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Woluona wanachike weli na inda na wokong'heza mdizua ijo! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Puleni ili kukimbila kwenu sekeiwe mazua ga mbeho hebu Zua da kuhumula! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kwavija msimo uwo hokua na gayo kulu hadipatile kulawila kulawa kulumbigwa kwa isi mbaka lelo, hebu gayo ijo hadidaha kulawila kaidi. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Kama mazua gago gahalekile kuhunguzigwa habule munhu yoyose yahahonyeke kukomigwa, mbali mazua gago gahunguzigwa kwa mbuli ya waja wasaguligwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Ivo, munhu yahawalongeleni zua ijo, ‘Kilisito kahano,’ ‘ebu Kilisito ka haja,’ sekemumtogole. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kwavija wolawilila walagusi wa uvwizi na wanhu wamwenga wolonga uvwizi kua wao kina kilisito. Wosang'hana vilaguso vikulu na uzonza ya kuwakanganya wanhu ihadahika hata kuwavwizila hata waja wasaguligwe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Tegelezeni, nimala kuwalalika kabula ya kulawila mbuli iyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Ivo, wahawalongeleni, ‘Loleni, Kilisito kakuluala,’ sekemwite uko, hebu, ‘loleni, Kilisito kaifisa mng'anda,’ sekemtogole. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Mwana wa munhu kokwiza kama lumwesa vuubung'hula kulawa muusimbukilo wa zua mbaka kuuswelo wa zua wouona, ivo vonda iwe kwiza kwake Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Haja hauli mtufi baho honda waikunzanye makwangule.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Vigamalile magayo ga mazua gago, zua dogeligwa ziza, mwezi haubung'hula, nhondo zolagala kulawa kuulanga, na udaho wa kuulanga wotigisigwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Amala chilaguso cha mwana munhu chooneka kuulanga, na baho makabala gose muuisi golomboleza, womona mwana munhu yokwiza kulawa mgamawingu ga kuulanga yeli na udaho na ukulu mwingi. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Nayo, kowalagiza watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu weli na mhalati zilila ng'hani, nawo wowakunzanya wasaguligwe wake kulawa mhande zose nne za isi, kulawa kuuhelelo uno mbaka uhelelo umwenga.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa mbiki wokemigwa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Muifunze mfano uno wa mbiki wa mtini, mala makwamvi gake gahasonga kusimbuka, movimanya kuwa msimo wa vuli uvika. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ivija na mweye mwahaona mbuli zino zose zogendelela, mvimanye kua msimo wa kubwela Mwana wa Munhu wahabehi kuvika. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Nowalongeleni kweli, ulelo uno haubita mbaka mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Ulanga na isi zobita, mbali Usega wangu haubita mbe.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habule yovimanya zua hebu saa yakubwela Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maluko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Mbali kwa mbuli ya zua ijo na saa iyo, habule munhu yovimanya, hebu watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, hebu Mwana wa Munhu, ila Tata yaiyeka iyo yovimanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Kwavija kama viikalile chipindi cha Nuhu, ivo yonda iwe kwiza kwa Mwana Munhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Manake chipindi icho, kabula ya bung'hukila kulu da mazi, wanhu wakala woja na kung'wa, wosola na kusoligwa mbaka Noa viyeingile mgati mwa ija ngalawa ng'hulu ikemigwa Safina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Wanhu hawamanyile choni chilawilile. Amala mvula itoa kwa chipindi chitali na wanhu wafa muibung'hukila ya mazi. Mwana wa Munhu honda yabwele, bahaja yolawila mchipindi ichija. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Chipindi icho wanhu waidi wokua mumgunda, imwe kosoligwa na imwenga kulekigwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Wanachike waidi wokua wodunda uhule mdibwe, imwe kusoligwa na imwenga kulekigwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Baho, muitande, kwavija hammanyile zua diyonda yabwele Mndewa wenu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Mbali sekemuisemwe mbuli ino, kama mwene kae yahavimanyile zua dija mbavi vonda yeze yahaitandile, hebu kuileke ng'anda yake ibomoligwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Kwaivo na mweye muitande, kwa vija Mwana wa Munhu kobwela muisaa ija mweye hamuimanyile.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumigwa msang'hana goya na ija hasang'hana goya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Ivo yelihi mtumigwa msang'hana goya na yeli na nzewele, ija mndewa wako komtenda yawalongoze wanhu wake, yaweng'he ndia kwa chipindi chake? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Kamweda mtumigwa ija mkulu wake yaheza komvika kosang'hana ivo. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nowalongela ukweli, komwika mtumigwa iyo yawimile uzenzi wake wose. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Mbali kama mtumigwa yehile yahailongela mmoyo, ‘Mkulu wangu kokawila kubwela,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />Labaho kasonga kuwatoa watumigwa wayage na kusonga kuja na kung'wa na wakoligwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Zua na saa ija haimanyile mkulu wake kobwela. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Komtoa vihile na kumwika fungu dimwe na waja hawamtegeleza. Uko kokua na ndilo na kuluma meno. Manake madununzo makali ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Mfano wa mhambe kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Chipindi icho, ufaume wa kuulanga woilinga na mhambe kumi wasolile vimuli vao, kuita kumbokela mfunga zengele. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Mmwao mwa waja mhambe kumi watano wakala wabozi na watano wakala na nzewele. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Waja wabozi wasola koloboi zao, mbali hawasolile mavuta ga usigavu. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Mbali waja weli na nzewele wasola mavuta ga usigavu na mzi koloboi zao. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Kwa vija mfunga zengele kakawa kuvika, waja mhambe wose wakukila wawasa. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Muichilo chikulu hakala na nyangi, ‘Cheleko, cheleko! Mfunga zengele kokwiza, gendeni mkambokele.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Baho waja mhambe wose walamka, wazitanda goya koloboi zao. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Waja wabozi wawalongela waja weli na nzewele, ‘Ching'heni mavuta genu chidogo manake koloboi zetu zofa.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Mbali waja weli na nzewele wawalongela, ‘Mavuta hagachenela cheye na mweye! Yofaya muite mmagenge mkaigulile mavuta genu!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ivo waja mhambe wabozi viwaitile kugula mavuta, mfunga zengele kavika, na waja mhambe waitandile goya wengila hamwe nayo muing'anda ya zengele, amala lwivi uhindigwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Hamwande waja mhambe wabozi weza, wakema, ‘Gomkulu, gomkulu, chivugulile! <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Mbali yeye kawedika, ‘Kweli nomlongeni, siwamanyile mweye.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Hachikomelezo Yesu kalonga, “Ivo itandeni, kwa vija hamdimanya zua hebu saa.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa watumigwa wadatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Chipindi icho yokuwa kama munhu imwe yafungile mwanza wa kutali. Kawakema watumigwa wake, kaweng'ha vinhu vake. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Kamwing'ha chila munhu vija viyodaha, imwe sente vikadi vitano va zahabu, na imwenga sente vikadi vidi va zahabu na imwenga sente kadi imwe ya zahabu, amala kafunga mwanza. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Bahaja ija yeng'higwe sente vikadi vitano kazisang'hanila sang'hano na zongezeka vikadi vimwenga vitano. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ivija ija yeng'higwe vikadi vidi va zahabu nayo zongezeka vikadi vidi va zahabu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Mbali ija yeng'higwe sente ya kikadi chimwe, kaita kahimba kombo muisi kakisila, kaifisa sente imwe ya zahabu ya mkulu wake.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Vichibitile chipindi chitali, mndewa ija kabwela, kasonga kupeta hisabu ya vinhu vake. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Mtumigwa yeng'higwe sente za zahabu tano keza, kasola zahabu tano fungu jongezeke, kamlongela, ‘Gomkulu kuning'ha sente zahabu tano, hano hana sente zahabu tano fungu jongezeke.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />‘Mkulu wake kamlongela, ‘Kusang'hana goya, mtumigwa unogile na utogoligwe. Kutogoligwa kwa mbuli ndodo ivo nokwing'ha gamwenga makulu. Izo udeng'helele hamwe na mkulu wako!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Mtumgwa yeng'higwe sente zahabu mbili keza, kalava zahabu mbili zongezeke, kalonga, ‘Gomkulu kuning'ha sente zahabu mbili, sola zahabu zimwenga mafungu maidi gongezeke gamhatile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />‘Mkulu wake kamlongela, ‘Kusang'hana goya mtumigwa unogile na utogoligwe. Kutogoligwa kwa mbuli ndodo ivo nokwing'ha gamwenga makulu. Izo udeng'helele hamwe na mkulu wako!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Mbali ija yeng'higwe sente zahabu imwe keza, kalonga ‘Gomkulu, nivimanya gweye hubunzagwa. Kosola chinhu si chako na kokwaha chinhu huchihandile. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Nidumba na niihimbila sente yako ya zahabu mdikombo. Sola basi sente yako imwe ya zahabu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />‘Mkulu wake kamlongela, ‘Gweye iyo mtumigwa mbananzi na mbwa! Kovimanya niye nokwaha chinhu sichihandile na nosola chinhu si changu. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ivo kulondeka, kuika sente yangu ya zahabu mwa wanhu wakuzisang'hanila sang'hano amala nihabwela mhate fungu jangu na dija fungu jongezeke. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Ivo, mbokeni iyo sente ya zahabu inimwing'ile mwing'heni munhu ija yeli na vikadi kumi va zahabu. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Manake, munhu yokisang'hanila sang'hano chinhu chinimwing'ile nomwongezela na chimwenga, nayo kokua navo vingi. Mbali munhu yoyose ija hakisang'hanila sang'hano chidodo chinimwing'ile, hata icho chidodo chiyeli nacho, nacho nomboka. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Na kwa mbuli ya ino mtumigwa yeli bule fungu chongezeke, mwaseni kunze mdizizi! Uko kokua na ndilo na kuluma meno.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamuzi wa zua da uhelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Mwana wa Munhu vonda yeze muukulu wake, na watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu wose weli hamwe nayo, baho kokala mchigoda chake cha ulongozi yeli mfaume. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Wanhu wa isi zose woiting'hana hamwake, nayo kowabagula wanhu kama vija msusilaji viyobagula bung'hukilalo na mbuzi. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Koweka bung'hukilalo ubanzi wake wa kulume na mbuzi ubanzi wake wa kumoso. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Amala mfaume kowalongela waja wa ubanzi wake wa kulume, ‘Izoni mweye mwing'higwe ganogile na Tata yangu, bokeleni ufaume utandiligwe kulawa kulumbigwa kwa isi zose. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kwavija nikala na nzala na mweye mning'ha ndia, nikala na ng'ilu na mweye mning'ha mazi, nikala nyambenyambe mmbokela, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />ng'hala bule chivalo mnivaza, nikala mtamu na mweye mwiza kunilola, nikala mdigeleza na mweye mwiza kunilola.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Baho waja wanhu wanogile wamwidika mfaume, ‘Mndewa, lini chikuona kuna nzala na cheye chikwing'ha ndia, hebu kukala na ng'ilu na cheye chikwing'ha mazi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Na kaidi lini chikuona uli nyambenyambe na cheye chikubokela, hebu kukala bila chivalo na cheye chikuvaza? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Na kaidi lini chikuona kukala mtamu hebu mfungigwa na cheye chiza kukulola?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Mfaume kowedika, ‘Nowalongeleni kweli, chila chinhu chimumtendele imwe mwa wano ndugu zangu wadodo mnhendela niye.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Amala kowalongela waja weli ubanzi wake wa kumoso, ‘Segeleni hamwangu mweye mwinukiligwe! Gendeni muumoto wa mazua gose ulibule uhelelo uja yatandiligwe Mwenembago na vinyamkela wake. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Manake nikala na nzala na mweye hamning'ile ndia, nikala la na ng'ilu na mweye hamning'ile mazi. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Nikala nyambenyambe na mweye hamnibokele ng'hala mtamu na nifungigwe na mweye hamwizile kunilola.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Nao baho womwidika, ‘Mndewa, lini chikuona kakala na nzala hebu ng'ilu hebu kukala nyambenyambe hebu bila chivalo, na kukala mtamu hebu mfungigwa, na cheye hachikusang'hanile? <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Nayo kowedikila, ‘Nowalongeleni kweli, chila vuumlekile kumtendele mbuli zino, imwe mwa wano wadodo, mkala mlema kunhendela niye.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Ivo, wano woita muulamuzi ulibule uhehelo, mbali waja watogoligwe woita muugima ulibule uhelelo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Chigwena cha kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Maluko 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu viyakomeleze kulonga gago gose, kawalongela waluko wake, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mvimanya kua mazua maidi hamwande hokua na lusona lwa Pasaka, na Mwana Munhu kolavingwa ili yawambingwe mumsalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Chipindi icho wakulu wa walava nhambiko na vilongozi wa Wayahudi waiting'hanila hamwe haluhelengo lwa Kayafa, mkulu wa walava nhambiko, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />wamwikila chigwena cha kumwamha Yesu kwa ubala ili wamkome. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Mbali walamula mbuli iyo seke itendeke mchipindi cha lusona lwa Pasaka, “Seke ilawilile ndwagi mwa wanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogidiligwa mavuta uko Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu viyakalile Betania, muing'anda ya Simoni, yeli na dikulu, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />mwanachike imwe yakalile na nhyupa ilumbigwe kwa dibwe da bei ng'hulu da alabasta ili na vinhung'ila va bei ng'hulu, kamuwinza Yesu haja hayakalile yoja ndia, kamgidila kinhung'ila icho mditwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Waluko wake viwaonile gago wagevuzika, walonga,“Ubananzi uno wachoni? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />“Mavuta gano gaguligwe kwa bei ng'hulu na sente izo waheng'higwe vikumbi muyega.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu kawamanya viwotonga kawalongela, “Habali momgaza mwanachike ino? Ino kanisang'hanila mbuli inogile. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Vikumbi myega mnao mazua gose, mbali nie sikala na mweye mazua gose. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Mwanachike ino kanigidila kinung'ila chino kwakunitanda kwambuli ya kuwandigwa kwangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Nowalongela kweli, hanu hohose mziisi haja Usenga wangu uhaliguligwa, mbuli zino ziyatendile mwanachike ino zolongigwa kwa ng'humbukizi yake.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotogola kumhinduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Amala Yuda isikaliyote, imwe mwawaja waluko kumi nawaidi, kaita kwa wakulu wa walava nhambiko, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />kawalongela, “Moning'ha choni nihamgala Yesu kumwenu?” Wampetela vihande salasini va madini ya feza, <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />kulawila baho Yuda kakala yolonda nzila vija vonda yamgale Yesu kumwao.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koja ndia ya Pasaka na waluko wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Mdizua da mosi ya lusona wa migate haigeligwe mela, waluko wake wamuwinza Yesu wamuuza, “Kolonda chikutandile halihi ndia ya lusona lwa Pasaka? <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yesu kawedikila, “Gendeni muikae kwa mulume imwe, mkamlongele, ‘Mfundaji kolonga, saa yangu ivika, kumwako noja ndia ya Pasaka hamwe na waluko wangu.’” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Waluko wasang'hana kama Yesu viyawalagize waitanda ndia ya lusona lwa Pasaka. <verse eid="MAT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Viivikile chigulogulo, Yesu kakala hamwe na waja waluko wake kumi na waidi wakala ili waje ndia. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Na viwakalile woja Yesu kalonga, “Kweli nowalongela, mienu imwe konihinduka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Waluko wake wapata usungu mmoyo, waiuza wenyego kwa wenyego, “Mndewa! Ivo, iyo nie?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu kawedika, “Yozang'ika gate hamwe nanie mdibakuli iyo yonda yanihinduke. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Enaa, Mwana Munhu kokwiza kudanganika kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigalonga, mbali koluona munhu ija yonda yamuhinduke Mwana Munhu! Ihawile goya ng'hani munhu iyo maza sekeyaleligwe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda, ija yamhinduke Yesu kamuuza, “Mfundaji! Ivo, iyo nie?” Yesu kamwidika, “Kulonga gweye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndia ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Viwakalile woja, Yesu kalava mgate, kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu, kaubanzula kaweng'ha waluko wake yolonga, “Soleni mje uno uo lukuli lwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Amala kasola chikombe cha divai, kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu, kaweng'ha yolonga, “Soleni mose mng'we divai ino, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />manake ino iyo damu yangu ilagusa lagano dino da kweli, damu itike kwa mbuli ya wanhu wengi ili kuwalekesela malozo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nowalongela, sing'wa kaidi divai ya mbiki wa zabibu mbaka zua ijo vonda ning'we divai ya sambi hamwe na mweye muufaume wa Tata yangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Viwamalile kwimba wila, wasegela waita kulugongo lwa mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga kua Petulo kokwiza kumbela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Chilo chino cha leo mweye mose monikimbila na kunileka, manake Mayandiko ga Mulungu golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">‘Nomtoa msusilaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">Na ng'ondolo wa bumbila wopwililika.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Mbali nihazilibuka nowalongolela kuita isi ya Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petulo kalonga, “Hata wose wahakuleka nie sikuleka, nie sikuleka mbee.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu kamlongela, “Nokulongela kweli, “Chilo cha lelo kabula nzogolo kwika, konibela mala nhatu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Baho Petulo kamwidika, “Hata ihalondika kufa hamwe na gweye, sikubela mbee.” Waja waluko wake walonga ivija.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kopula mdikonde da Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Amala Yesu kaita hamwe na waluko wake mdikonde da Getisemane, kawalongela waluko wake, “Kaleni hano nanie noita haja hamwande kupula.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Kawasola Petulo na wana waidi wa Zebedayo, kasonga kua na giogio na kugaya, <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />na kawalongela, “Nina giogio ng'hani mmoyo behi na kudanganika. Kaleni hano muwase meso na nie.” <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Ivo, kaita hamwande kidogo kagwa chifudifudi kapula, “Tata yangu kama ihadahika chikombe chino cha madununzo chinileke, mbali sio kama vinilonda mbali vuulonda gweye.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Amala kawabwelela waja waluko wake wadatu kawavika wawasa, kamlongela Petulo, “Ivo kulonga mpotigwa kuwasameso na nie hata saa imwe? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Ivo, muwasemeso na kupula sekemgezigwe. Mweye molonda kusang'hana mbali ng'huli zenu zabule ludabwa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Kaita mala ya kaidi kupula, “Tataangu kama haidahika chikombe chibite bila nie kuching'wa, basi duulonda ditendeke.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Kawabwelela kaidi kawavika wawasa, manake meso gao gakala na utulo ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Ivo, kawaleka, kaita tena kupula mala ya kadatu kwambuli iija. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Amala kawabwelela waja waluko kawalongela, “Ivo mng'hali muwasa na kuhumula? Loleni! Saa ivika, Mwana Munhu kolavigwa kwa wanhu weli na malozo. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Lamkeni chiteni. Loleni kokwiza ija yolonda kunihinduka.<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Ivo, Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga nao, bahaja keza Yuda imwe mwa waja waluko wake kumi na waidi. Keza na wanhu wengi weli na mapanga na malungu wakala walagizigwe na wakulu wa walava nhambiko na wavele wa wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yuda yalondile kumhinduka Yesu kalala kaweng'ha chilaguso kalonga, “Iyo yonda nimlamse kwa kumhagatila iyo mmwamhe!”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Ivo, Yuda kamuwinza Yesu habehi kamlongela, “Mwinyi mfundaji!” Amala kamhagatila. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu kamulongela, “Mbwiga, sang'hana chija chuuwinzile.” Baho wanhu waja weza wamgoga wamgela nzabi. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Munhu imwe yakalile hamwe na Yesu kasomola panga jake kamkanha gutwi mtumigwa wa mkulu wa walava nhambiko. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Baho Yesu kamlongela, “Bweleza panga jako mui yala yake, kwavija yoyose yotumila panga kokomigwa kwa panga.<verse eid="MAT 26:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Ivo, hammanyile kua nihadahile kumpula Tataangu nayo bahaja yahanitaze kungalila mabumbila kumi na maidi ga watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Mbali govikaze Mayandiko ga Mulungu galonga kua ivo viilondeka iwe?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Amala Yesu kawalongela wanhu waja wezile kumgoga, “Ivo, mwiza na mapanga na malungu kunigoga kama munhu mbavi? Mazua gose ng'hala Muing'anda ya Mulungu nofunda, na hamngogile! <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Mbali gano gose galawila ili Mayandiko ga walagusi wa Mulungu gavikile.” Amala waluko wose wamleka, wakimbila.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa mchitala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maluko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Baho wanhu waja wamgogile Yesu wamgala ukae kwa Kayafa, mkulu wa walava nhambiko uko hawaiting'hanile wafunda ndagizi za Musa na wavele. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Petulo kamuwinza kwa kutali mbaka kuulua wa mkulu wa walava nhambiko, kengila muulua na kakala hasi na wamilizi ili yaone chonda chilawilile. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Ivo wakulu wa nhambiko na chitala chose walonda mbuli za uvwizi wapate kumkoma Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />mbali hawapatile mbuli yoyose, hata kama weza wanhu wengi walonga uvwizi. Hachikomelezo weza walonga uvwizi waidi, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />walonga, “Munhu ino kalonga, ‘Nodaha kubomola ng'anda ya Mulungu na kuizenga kaidi kwa mazua madatu.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mkulu wa nhambiko kema kamuuza Yesu, “Ivo, kwabule da kuwedika? Wanhu wano wokulonga choni?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Mbali Yesu kanyamala hupii. Mkulu wa nhambiko kamlongela, “Nokulahiza kwa Mulungu yeli na ugima, chilongele kama gweye iyo Kilisito Mwana wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu kamulongela, “Gweye kulonga. Mbali nomlongelani, kulawila sambi momuona Mwana wa Munhu kakala ubanzi wa kulume kwa ija Mulungu yeli na udaho, yokwiza mgamawingu ga kuulanga!” <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Baho mkulu wanhambiko kadega vivalo vake kwa ludoko kalonga, “Kaliga! Cholonda choni kaidi wakulonga ubananzi wake na mweye muhulika maligo gake. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Mweye moonaze?” Wao wamwidika, “Kolondeka yafe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Amala wamtemela mate mchihanga, wamtoa mang'hua. Wamwenga viwakalile womtoa mang'hua, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />wamlongela Yesu,”Fisula yelihi yakutoile!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maluko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Petulo kakala yakalile kunze muulua, baho mtumigwa imwe wa chike kamuwinza kamlongela, “Gweye kulala hamwe na Yesu wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Petulo kabela hawanhu wose kalonga, “Sikimanyanya chuulonga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Viyalile yolawa kuita haulwivi, mtumigwa imwenga kamuona kawalongela waja wakalile haja, “Munhu ino kakala hamwe na Yesu wa Nazaleti.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petulo kabela kaidi kwa kuilahila, “Simmanyile munhu iyo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Hamwande chidogo wanhu wakalile haja wamuinza Petulo wamlongela, “Kweli gweye kwahamwe nayo, manake ulonzi wako wochilagusa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Baho Petulo kasonga kuilahila yolonga, “Simmanyile munhu ino!” Bahaja nzogolo keka, <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Petulo kakumbuka mbuli ziyalongiligwe na Yesu kua, “Kabula nzogolo hanakwika konibela mala nhatu.” Ivo, kalawa hanze, kalila ng'hani kwa giogio.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maluko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luka 23:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Viivikile lukwili, wakulu wa Walava nhambiko wose na vilongozi wa Wayahudi wailongela vija viwalonda wamkome Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Wamgela loda, wamsola, wamgala kuing'anda ya Pilato, mkulu wa isi ya Loma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda koibota</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Sang’hano za Wasenga 1:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Baho Yuda, ija yakalile yamhinduke Yesu, viyaonile wamala kumlamula Yesu kumkoma, baho kalumila ng'hani mmoyo, kawabwelezela vija vihande salasini va madini ga feza. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Kawalongela, “Nibananga kumlava munhu yelibule ubananzi yakomigwe.” Mbali wao walonga, “Ivo cheye chitendeze? Ijo jako mwenyego.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Baho Yuda kavasa vija vihande va madini ga feza mui Kae ya Mulungu, kalawa kunze, kaita kuibota. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Waja wakulu wa Walava nhambiko wazisola zija sente walonga, “Hazifaya kuzika msigavu wa ng'anda ya Mulungu kwavija ni sente za damu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ivo waitogolela kugulila mgunda wa mlumba nongo uwe hanhu hakuwandila wanyambenyambe. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Lekaavo mbaka lelo mgunda uwo wokemigwa mgunda wa damu. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Baho gayalongile mlagusi wa Mulungu Yelemia gavikila, “Wasola vihande salasini va madini ga feza, bei ng'hulu ya ija wanhu wa Izilaeli wamgula, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />watumila sente izo kugulila mgunda wa mlumba nongo, kama Mndewa viyanilagize.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato komuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maluko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu kemizigwa hamkulu wa isi. Baho mkulu wa isi kamuuza, “Ivo gweye iyo mfaume wa Wayahudi?” Yesu kamlongela, “Gweye kolonga. <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Mbali wakulu wa nhambiko na wavele viwakalile womlongeleza, hedikile mbuli. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Baho Pilato kamuuza, “Ivo, huhulika gago gose gawakulongeleza?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Mbali Yesu hedikile hata mbuli imwe, hata ivo mkulu wa isi ya Loma kakanganya ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolamuligwa yakomigwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohana 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Baho ikala mazoela gake mkulu wa isi kuwalekesela mfungwa imwe ija iwomulonda wanhu muindeng'helelo ya Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Chipindi icho hakala na mfungwa imwe yamanyike ng'hani kwa gehile gayasang'hane zina jake Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ivo, wanhu viwaiting'hanile hamwe, Pilato kawauza, “Molonda niwalekesele yelihi mwa wano waidi, Balaba hebu Yesu yokemigwa Kilisito.” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pilato kalonga ivo, kwavija kavimanya wamgala kumwake kwa mbuli ya migongo.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilato viyakalile mchigoda cha ulamuzi, mwehe wake kamgalila usenga, “Sekewingile muulamuzi wa munhu ino mtenda goya, kwavija lelo nigaya ng'hani mzinzozi kwambuli yake.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Mbali wakulu wa walava nhambiko na wavele wawaswangiza wanhu wampule Pilato yamlekese Balaba na Yesu yakomigwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Mkulu wa isi ija kawauza, “Yelihi mwa wano waidi imulonda niwalekesele?” Wamwidika, “Balaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato kawauza, “Ivo nimtendeze ino Yesu yokemigwa Kilisito?” Wose walonga, “Yawambigwe!” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato kauza, “Habali? Katenda dilihi dihile?” Wao wagendelela kwinula dizi, “Muwambe mumsalaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Ivo, Pilato viyamanyile kua hadaha kupata chochose na ndwagi zosonga, kasola mazi na kasunha makono gake haulongozi ha wanhu kalonga, “Nie siona mbuli ihile yoyose iyatendile munhu ino yakumtenda yakomigwe, mmane mweye wenyego.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Wanhu wose walonga, “Gehile gano gawe na cheye na wanetu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Baho Pilato kawalekesela Balaba, na kalagiza wanhu wamlibule Yesu miboko amala kamlava wakamuwambe.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamilizi womzeha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maluko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Yohana 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Amala wamilizi wa mkulu wa isi ya Loma wamgala Yesu muing'anda iyokala mkulu wa Loma, wamzungulukila bumbila jose da wamilizi. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Wamvula vivalo vake na kumvaza valo dung'hu da kifaume. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Amala wazinga chigalama cha miwa wamwika mditwi, amala wamwikila dete mumkono wake wakulume. Wamtumbalila mavindi wamzeha wolonga, “Haligani mfaume wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Wamtemela mate, wadisola dija dete, wamtoa nao mditwi kusindilila kija chigalama cha miwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Viwamalile kumzeha, wamvula dija valo da kifaume, wamvaza valo jake amala wamgala kumuwamba mumsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambigwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Viwakalile woita wamvika munhu imwe yokemigwa Simoni mwenekae wa Kulene, wamswangiza ausole msalaba wa Yesu yaupape. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Viwavikile hanhu hokemigwa Goligota, manake, “Hanhu kama vuha da ditwi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Wamwing'ha divai ihanganyigwe na kiliusungu. Mbali viyalanzile kalema kung'wa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Wamuwamba, amala waigolela vivalo vake kwa kutoa simbi. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Wakalahasi womwamila. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Hachanha ha ditwi jake mumsalaba wandika gaja gawamulonga, “Ino iyo Yesu Mfaume wa Wayahudi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Amala wabavi waidi wawambigwa hamwe nayo, imwe mumsalaba wa kulume imwenga mumsalaba wa kumoso. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Wanhu wakalile wobita baho, wamliga Yesu kwa kutigisa magutwi gao wolonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />gweye sikulonga kodaha kubomola ng'anda ya Mulungu na kuizenga mmazua madatu! Haya ilohole mwenyego. Kama gweye Mwana Mulungu, kwaivo hulumuka mumsalaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Ivija wakulu wa Walava nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi na vilongozi wa Wayahudi wamzeha Yesu walonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />Kawalohola wamwenga, mbali kuilohola mwenyego hadaha! Ivo iyo si mfaume wa Wayahudi! Kwaivo na yahulumuke mumsalaba, nacheye chomtogola! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Kamtumanila Mulungu na kulonga eti iyo Mwana wa Mulungu baho Mulungu nayamulohole kama kweli komlonda. <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Na ivija waja wabavi waidi wawambigwe hamwe nayo wamuliga.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kulawa saa sita imisi ziza digubika isi yose mbaka saa tisa. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Viivikile saa tisa Yesu kalila kwa dizi kulu,“Eloi, Eloi lamasabakitani? Manake, “Mulungu wangu, Mulungu wangu, habali kundeka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Mbali waja wemile haja viwahulike ivo walonga, “Komkema Elia.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Miyao imwe kakimbila kasola dodoki kadizabika muisiki, kaika mdidete, kamwing'ha Yesu yang'we. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Wamwenga walonga, “Leka chilole kama Elia kokwiza kumlohola.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Baho, Yesu kalila kwa dizi kulu amala kadanganika. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Baho golole tali da ng'anda ya Mulungu didegeka vihande vidi kulawila uchanha mbaka hasi, isi itigisika na mabwe gatulika, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />mapanga gafunhuka na wanhu wadanganike wazilibuligwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Nayo Yesu viyazilibuke, walawa mmapanga wengila muikae inang'hane na waoneka na wanhu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Ivo, mkulu wa wamilizi na waja wakalile womkimila Yesu viwaonile gudemo da isi na gaja galawilile, wadumba ng'hani walonga, “Ino kweli kakala Mwana wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Hanhu baho hakala wanachike wengi wolola kwa kutali, wao wamsondelele Yesu kulawa Galilaya kuno womhunganikila. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Imwe mmwao kakala Malia wa Magdala na Malia mamiyao Yakobo na Yosefu na mami yao wana Zabedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowandigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Viivikile chigulogulo, keza munhu imwe mnzenzi kulawa Alimataya yokemigwa Yusufu, iyo ivija kakala mwaluko wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Kamuwinza Pilato kampula yeng'higwe lukuli lwa Yesu, baho Pilato katogola yeng'higwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusufu kausola lukuli wa Yesu, kauzinga sitili nzelu ya kitani, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />kawika mdipanga jake dinogile diyasongole mdibwe. Amala kabimbilisa dibwe kulu haulwivi lwa panga na kasegela. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Malia wa Magdala na ija Malia imwenga wakala wakalile kudilola panga.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamilizi wokwamila panga da Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Igolo yake, ikalile zua da kaidi kulawa Zua da kuhumula, wakulu wa walava nhambiko na Mafalisayo wamuwinza Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />walonga, “Gomkulu, chikumbuka kua ija mvwizi kalonga kabula hanadanganika eti, ‘Mmazua madatu hamwande nozilibuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Kwaivo lagiza wanhu wakimile panga mmazua madatu ili waluko wake seke weze wamwibe na kuwalongela wanhu kua Yesu kazilibuka. Uvwizi uno wachikomelezo wokwiha ng'hani kubita uja ulongole.” <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato kawalongela, “Goya, mnao wamilizi gendeni mkamile vija vumdaha.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ivo waita, wadikimila dija panga, wagela chilaguso mwa dija dibwe na kuleka wamilizi wamile.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kuzilibuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maluko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Vidibitile zua da kuhumula Wayahudi, behi na mitondo ya zua da jumapili, Malia wa Magidala na ija Malia imwenga waita kudilola panga. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Bahaja dilawila gudemo kulu da isi, mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu wa Mndewa kahulumuka kulawa kuulanga, kadibimbilisa dibwe na kudilava haulwivi amala kadikalila. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Mtumigwa iyo wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kaoneka kama lumwesa na vivalovake vake vikala vizelu chwee. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Waja wamilizi wa panga wagudemeka kwa kudumba ng'hani, wakala kama wadanganike. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Mbali ija mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kawalongela waja wanachike, “Mweye sekemdumbe! Nivimanya kua momzambwila Yesu yawambigwe mumsalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Kahabule hano, manake kazilibuka kama viyalongile. Izoni mulole haja hayakalile kawasa.<verse eid="MAT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Ivo, lopoleni gendeni mkawalongele waluko wake kua kazilibuka, na sambi kawalongoleleni kuja Galilaya, uko konda mmuone. Onaa nimala kuwalongela.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ivo weli na gudemo na ndeng'helo ng'hulu, wanachike waja walawa hima mdipanga, wakimbila kuita kuwalongela waluko wake.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Bahaja, Yesu kaiting'hana nao kalonga, “Haligani.” Wanachike waja wamuwinza, wamtumbalila mavindi, wamwamha magulu gake. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Sekemdumbe! Gendeni mkawalongele walukolo wangu waite Galilaya, na uko woniona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamilizi wogala usenga kwa wakulu zao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Waja wanachike viwakalile woita, wamilizi wamwenga wa dija panga waita kuikae kulonga gaja galawilile kwa wakulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Ivo waiting'hana hamwe na wavele, na viwamalile kuilongela, waweng'ha waja wamilizi sente nyingi.<verse eid="MAT 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />Wawalongela, “Mweye molonga vino, ‘Waluko wake weza ichilo wamwiba cheye vichikalile chiwasa.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Kama mkulu wa isi ya Loma yahaimanya mbuli ino seke mgae cheye cholonga nayo na hampata mbuli yoyose.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Wamilizi waja wazisola sente zija, watenda kama viwalongiligwe. Mbuli ija yenela mwa Wayahudi mbaka lelo.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila waluko wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sang’hano za Wasenga 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Baho waja waluko kumi na imwe waita Galilaya kulugongo uja yawalagize Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Viwamuone Yesu wamfugamila, mbali wamwenga wakala womkanganya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu kawawinza habehi, kawalongela, “Ning'higwa ulongozi wose muisi na kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Ivo, gendeni mkawatende wanhu wa isi zose kua waluko wangu, mhawabatiza kwa zina da Tata na da Mwana na da Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Na wafundeni kugoga ndagizi zose zinimwing'heni. Nanie nokala na mweye mazua gose, enaa, mbaka hauhelelo mwa ugima.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>